<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1CO" style="id">Dai-Chin: Bible Translation 1st Edition</book>
  <para style="ide">Unicode (UTF-8)</para>
  <para style="h">1 Korintuh</para>
  <para style="toc1">KORINTUHEA veia Pawluha Cayuk Akcüknak</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Korintuh</para>
  <para style="toc3">1Kor</para>
  <para style="mt1">KORINTUHEA</para>
  <para style="mt2">Veia Pawluha Cayuk Akcüknak</para>
  <para style="imt">Pyenhlüma</para>
  <para style="ip">Pawluh naw a mdüihmthawh hüt sangcim k'uma Khritjan kcünsak ja jumeinak am sängeikia akhakhai a phäh Pawluh a ca yuk akcüka kyaki. Acuna kcün üng Korin cun kun jawihtuknak Krik mlüh, Romah hne Achaia a mlüh ktunga kyaki. Korin cun jawihtuk dämdaki, vecawh ning, am dawkia ngneisak ja pata a nung mjaa phäh nglo ngthangki. Ngsä naw aktunga a yuk ta sangcim k'uma ngtainak, sangcim k'uma ngnei kse, sangcima cehcawn ning, khyunglaa mawng ngthähnak, ksingeinak, Ngmüimkhya Ngcima bänake ja thawhnak be a mawngea kyaki. Thang kdaw cun naw a na ngthähnake a ksinga a pyennaka kyaki. Akhyang kdäm 13 naw mhläkphyanak hin Pamhnam naw a khyange üng akdaw säih bänak a ja pet ti cun cauk k'uma jah ksingsaki.</para>
  <para style="iot">Amawng ktawie</para>
  <para style="io1">Tüneinak (1:1-9)</para>
  <para style="io1">Sangcim k'uma ana (1:10—4:21)</para>
  <para style="io1">Hüipawmnak ja im khyawnga ngneisak (5:1—7:40)</para>
  <para style="io1">Khritjane ja am khritjane (8:1—11:1)</para>
  <para style="io1">Sangcima kcünsak ja mküimtonak (11:2—14:40)</para>
  <para style="io1">Khritawa thawhnak be ja jumeikiea thawhnak be (15:1-58)</para>
  <para style="io1">Judah Khritjanea phäh petmsawtnak (16:1-4)</para>
  <para style="io1">Khyang mat üng sängeikie ja apäihnak (16:5-24)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1CO 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 1:1"/>Pamhnama hlüeia khü Jesuh Khritawa ngsä, kei Pawluh jah ka na Soten naw,<verse eid="1CO 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 1:2"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 18:1">Ngs 18:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Korintuh mlüha vekia Pamhnama sangcime, Khritaw Jesuh üng khyang ngcima kya khaie a jah khüe, hnün naküt üng mi Bawipa Jesuh Khritaw mküimtokie naküta veia;<verse eid="1CO 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 1:3"/>Mi Pa, Pamhnam jah Bawipa Jesuh Khritawa veia ka bäkhäknak ja dimdeihnak nami khana ve se.<verse eid="1CO 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="s">Khritaw üng dawkyanak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 1:4"/>Khritaw Jesuh üngkhyüh Pamhnama bäkhäknak aning jah peta phäha Pamhnama veia aläa jenak ka mthehki.<verse eid="1CO 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 1:5"/>Khritaw üng yümmat lü ngthu pyennak jah ksingnak üng, amät üng bawimang u lü, nami vea phäha kyaki. <verse eid="1CO 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 1:6"/>Acukba Khritaw a ngthu ka ning jah ksingsak nangmi üng khäng lü veki cän ni; <verse eid="1CO 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 1:7"/>A dawkyanak yah lü, mi Bawipa Jesuh Khritawa a ngdannak law vai k'äihei ua. <verse eid="1CO 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 1:8"/>Mi Bawipa Jesuh Khritaw a Khaw mhnüp a pha law üng, apäihnak veia ning jah khängsak lü nami mkhye am ve. <verse eid="1CO 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 1:9"/>Mi Bawipa kyakia, a Capa Jesuh Khritaw am yümat khaia jah khüikia Pamhnam cun ümnak vai ni.<verse eid="1CO 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Sangcim k'uma ngtainak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 1:10"/>Ka püie aw, mi Bawipa Jesuh Khritawa ana sumei lü avan ning jah nghüinak ta nami pyen üng ä ti yüm lü nami ksunga ngtainak am ve. Cungaihnak ja ti tängnak üng yüm mat ua. <verse eid="1CO 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 1:11"/>Ka püie aw, nami ngcungkaih veki tia mawng cun Kalokuha khui im kyawng lawng naw na mthehkie ni. <verse eid="1CO 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 1:12"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:24">Ngs 18:24</ref></char></note>Ahinni ka pyen cun, khyang naküt naw, “Kei Pawluha hnu kläk ni” “Kei Apawluha hnu kläk ni” “Kei Kiphaha hnu kläk ni” “Kei Khritawa hnu kläk ni” nami tiki. <verse eid="1CO 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 1:13"/>Khritaw cun ngkhawipaki aw?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:13:</char><char style="fq" closed="false">Khritaw cun ngkhawipaki aw; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">avang yuknake üngta</char><char style="fq" closed="false">Khritaw am ngkhawipa thei.</char></note> Pawluh nami phäha kutlamktung üng thiki aw? Am ani üng, Pawluha ngming am baptican nami ngkhamki aw?<verse eid="1CO 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 1:14"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:14:a </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 18:8">Ngs 18:8</ref>; </char>
      <char style="xo" closed="false">b</char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 19:29">Ngs 19:29</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 16:23">Rom 16:23</ref></char>
    </note>Pamhnam je na veng isetiakyaküng Kripuh ja Kajas däk ni baptican ka jah pet, nangmi üng u pi baptican am pe veng. <verse eid="1CO 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 1:15"/>Am aniüng, khyang naw, keia ngming am baptican nami ngkhamkia ngai khaie ni. <verse eid="1CO 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 1:16"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 16:15">1Kor 16:15</ref></char></note>Stephena kyawnglawng ta baptican ka jah ngkhamsakki; acuna thea khyang kce baptican ka ja khamsak u am ksing veng. <verse eid="1CO 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 1:17"/>Khritaw naw baptican ka jah khamsak khaia am na tüih law. Thangkdaw pyen üng ksingkhyapnak am sumei hin Khritawa kutlamtunga johit käh a khyüh vaia ni.<verse eid="1CO 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Khritawa johit ja Pamhnama themnak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 1:18"/>Kutlamtunga mawng cun khyükie phäha ta amdang ni; mimi küikyannak yakiea phäha ta Pamhnama khyaihnak ni. <verse eid="1CO 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 1:19"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 29:14">Hesa 29:14</ref> (LXX)</char></note>“Khyang kthema ksingkhyapnak mkhyüh lü, ksinghmatnak pi ka kpyak khai” tia cangcim naw pyenki.<verse eid="1CO 1:19"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 1:20"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:20: a</char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 12:17">Job 12:17</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 19:12">Hesa 19:12</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 33:18">33:18</ref>; </char>
      <char style="xo" closed="false">b</char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 44:25">Hesa 44:25</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Khyang kthem cun hawa ni? Thum ksingki cun hawa ni? Hina khawmdek khana ngcungkaih khyaihki cun hawa ni? Pamhnam naw khawmdeka kthemnak cun angnak ni tia, mdan pängki ni. <verse eid="1CO 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 1:21"/>Khawmdek khyanga ksingnak üng Pamhnam cun ksing lü am ng’yah. Ak’anga ngthukhyü ami ti cun pyen lü jum ti cun Pamhnam naw küikyan ve. <verse eid="1CO 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 1:22"/>Judahe naw, müncannak kthäh u lü Krike naw kthemnak suikie, <verse eid="1CO 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 1:23"/>keimie naw ta Khritaw kutlamtung üng taiha mawng kami pyenki, acun cun Judahea phäha kyukngtängnak kya lü, Khyangmjü kceea phäha angnaka kyaki. <verse eid="1CO 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 1:24"/>Acunsepi, Judahea pi kyase, Krikea pi kyase, Pamhnama khüea phäha ta Khritawa ngthu cun Pamhnama khyaihnak ja Pamhnama ksingnaka kyaki ni. <verse eid="1CO 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 1:25"/>Pamhnama angnak cun nghngicima ksingnaka kthaka kyäp bawki, Pamhnama am kyannak mäi cän pi nghngicima kyannaka kthaka kyäp bawki ni.<verse eid="1CO 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 1:26"/>Ka püie aw, a ning jah khünak cän ngai süm ua, pumsa lama khyang kthem khawhah, khyang kyan khawhah, khyang kdaw khawhah am jah khü ve. <verse eid="1CO 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 1:27"/>Acunsepi, Pamhnam naw khyang ktheme a jah hmaisetsak vaia, khawmdek üng angkie jah khüki, ktha mahkie a jah hmaisetsak vaia, khawmdek üng ktha ngcekie ja khüki. <verse eid="1CO 1:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 1:28"/>Acunüng, kyäpkie ia am ngtäh khaiea khawmdek üng aksee jah hmuhmsitkie, am ngtähkie Pamhnam naw jah khüki. <verse eid="1CO 1:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 1:29"/>Acunakyase, Pamhnama hmaia u am awcah thei. <verse eid="1CO 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 1:30"/>Nangmi ta, amäta phäha, Khritaw Jesuh üng nami vekie ni, pamhnam naw Khritaw cun mi hama themnaka a pawh ni, ani am mimi cun Pamhnam üng ngsungpyunkia a jah pawh, acuna phäh Pamhnama khyang ngcima mi kya lü mi lätki. <verse eid="1CO 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 1:31"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 9:24">Jer 9:24</ref></char></note>Acunakyase, “Awhcahki naküt naw Bawipa awhcah na se” Cangcim naw tiki.<verse eid="1CO 1:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1CO 2"/>
  <para style="s">Kutlamktung üng taih Jesuha mawng</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 2:1"/>Ka püie aw, nami veia law lü, ngthupkia Pamhnama ngthungtak<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:1:</char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ngthupkia Pamhnama ngthungtak; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">avang yuknake üng veki</char><char style="fq" closed="false">Pamhnama saksia mawng.</char></note> ka ning ja mtheh üng, ngthu mpyawng mahnak ja ksingnak am sumei veng. <verse eid="1CO 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 2:2"/>Jesuh Khritaw kutlamktung üng taiha ngthua thea nami veia ka, ka ksing vai am ve. <verse eid="1CO 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 2:3"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:9">Ngs 18:9</ref></char></note> Nangmia vei ka law üng ktha ngcek lü cäi lü ngkhyet veng. <verse eid="1CO 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 2:4"/>Ka pyen ja ka mtheimthangnak cun nghngicima khyaihnaka ngthu üng pyena am kya lü, Pamhnama Ngmüimkhya ja johit üng ni akya ve. <verse eid="1CO 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 2:5"/>Nami jumnak cun Pamhnama johita kya lü nghngicima ksingnaka am kya.<verse eid="1CO 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pamhnama kthemnak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 2:6"/>Jumeinak üng dämduh pängki veia pumngyam mah akba kami ngthukhyüki. Ahina pumngyam cun khawmdek upkiea asäng üng khyük be theikia khawmdek pumngyam am ni. <verse eid="1CO 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 2:7"/>Khawmdek am a ngtün law ham üngka naw mi hlüngtainak vaia axü päng, acun cun khyang üngka naw ngthupkia Pamhnam pumngyam ni kami sang ta. <verse eid="1CO 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 2:8"/>Acun cun hina khawmdek upkie naw am ksing u, ami ksing vai sü ta hlüngtainaka Bawipa kutlamktung üng am ami taih vai sü.<verse eid="1CO 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 2:9"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 64:4">Hesa 64:4</ref>
      </char>
    </note> “Mik üng am hmuh, hnga üng am ngjak,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 2:9">nghngicima mlung üng am lutki,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 2:9">Pamhnam naw ani mhläkphyanakiea phäha a pitpyang ni” tia Cangcim naw pyenki.<verse eid="1CO 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 2:10"/>
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">2:10:</char>
      <char style="fq" closed="false">lüpi</char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">avang yuknake üng veki</char>
      <char style="fq" closed="false">phäh.</char>
    </note>Mimi cun, acuna ngthu Pamhnama Ngmüimkhya naw jah ksingsaki ni. Ngmüimkhya naw avan naküt cun suihjap lü, Pamhnama ngthupkia nümnak pi ksing theiki. <verse eid="1CO 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 2:11"/>Mi Ngmüimkhya naw ni, mi mäta mawng a ksing. Acuna mäiha Pamhnama Ngmüimkhya naw ni Pamhnama mawng a ksing ta. <verse eid="1CO 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 2:12"/>Acunakyase, khawmdeka ngmüimkhya am mi yaki. Pamhnama a jah pete mi jah ksingnak thei vaia Pamhnama veia ka, Pamhnama Ngmüimkhya mi yahki.<verse eid="1CO 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 2:13"/>
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">2:13:</char>
      <char style="fq" closed="false">Ngmüimkhya takie; </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">am ani üng</char>
      <char style="fq" closed="false">Ngmüimkhya naw a jah peta khyübe üng.</char>
    </note>Cuna kyalü Ngmüimkhya takie, Ngmüimkhya üng sängki kami jah mtheha kba kami khyübe hin khyanga themnak naw a jah mthei am pyen lü Ngmüimkhya a jah mthei khyübe ni kami pyen. <verse eid="1CO 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 2:14"/>Pamhnama Ngmüimkhya üngkhyüh lawki letsawnge cun Ngmüimkhya am taki naw am doei thei. Ngmüimkhya am taki naw acubange cun akcanga am jah ksing lü i ja pi am jah ngai, isetikyaküng amimi cun Ngmüimkhya lam üng jah msuimsäpa kya se ni. <verse eid="1CO 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 2:15"/>Ngmüimkhya khyang cun naw avana ngthumkhyah theiki, acunsepi, ani cun u naw ngthu am mkhya thei. <verse eid="1CO 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 2:16"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:13">Hesa 40:13</ref> (LXX)</char></note></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 2:16">U naw, Bawipaa mlung ksingki ni?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 2:16">U naw a dawnak vai mtheh thei khai ni?</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1CO 2:16">Mimi cun Khritawa mlung mi taki.<verse eid="1CO 2:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1CO 3"/>
  <para style="s">Pamhnama mpyae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 3:1"/>Ka püie, akcanga ta kei hin naw Ngmüimkhya takie vei ka pyen akba nami veia pyen lü am ng’yah. Kei cun naw khawmdek üng nami säng hamkia kya se Khritaw üng hnasena kba ni ka ning jah mtheh. <verse eid="1CO 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 3:2"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 5:12">Heb 5:12</ref>,<ref loc="HEB 5:13">13</ref></char></note>Kei naw angcang käh ning jah mbei lü cihtui ni ka ning jah tu. Isetiakyaküng nangmi cun angcang am ei thei ham u ki. Tuh pi am ei thei ham u ki. <verse eid="1CO 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 3:3"/>Isetiakyaküng, hin khawmdeka khyange xüna kba nami xüngkiea kyase ni. Hmuhmsitnak ja ngvawknak nami ksunga vekia kyase, pumsa khyanga kya u lü, khawmdek khyanga vea mäiha nami ve hamkia am kyaki aw? <verse eid="1CO 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 3:4"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 1:12">1Kor 1:12</ref></char></note>Nangmi üngka mat naw, “Pawluh ka läki” akce naw, “Apawluh ka läki” nami ti ta, khawmdek khyangea kba nami vecawhki am ni aw?<verse eid="1CO 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 3:5"/>U ni Apawluh ta? U ni Pawluh ta? Nami jum vai ja ning jah cehpüiki Pamhnama mpyaea kani kyaki. Bawipa a jah mtat khut bikia mat cima kani kyaki. <verse eid="1CO 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 3:6"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:6:a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:4-11">Ngs 18:4-11</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:24-28">Ngs 18:24-28</ref></char></note>Kei naw ka nglinki, Apawluh naw tui buiki, acunsepi, Pamhnam naw va dämsaki. <verse eid="1CO 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 3:7"/>Acunakyase, dämsaki cun Pamhnam kya lü nglinki ja buiki naw i am khyaih khawh. <verse eid="1CO 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 3:8"/>Mci sawki ja tui buiki hngalangnak am ve, ani pawha kba Pamhnam naw jah thung be khai. <verse eid="1CO 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 3:9"/>Nangmi cun Pamhnama laia kya lü keimie cun Pamhnama phäh atänga khut kami biki. Nangmi cun Pamhnama imloa pi nami kyaki. <verse eid="1CO 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 3:10"/>Pamhnam naw a na pet bäkhäknak sumei lü sawngsa theikia bilawh akba tüneinak ka taki. A cuna khana akce naw sawngsaki. Lüpi nangmi mat cim naw ihawkba nami sawngsak cun sitih ua. <verse eid="1CO 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 3:11"/>Pamhnam naw tüneinak mat däka kyaki Jesuh Khritaw a tak pänga kya lü u naw pi tüneinak akce am ta yah. <verse eid="1CO 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 3:12"/>Avang naw xüi, ngui ja aphumah lung sumei lü tüneinaka khana sawngsa khaie. Akcee naw thing, mphyaw ja cangkpa sumei khaie. <verse eid="1CO 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 3:13"/>Khyang mat cima bilawh cun Khritawa khawmhnüp naw mdan law lü mi hmu law khai. Acuna mhnüp üng khyang naküta bilawh cun mei naw kcet lü akcang cun mdan khai. <verse eid="1CO 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 3:14"/>Tüneinaka khana jah sawngsak cun mei naw amceih ta sawngsaki naw ngkhyengnak yah khai. <verse eid="1CO 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 3:15"/>Na bilawh mei naw a uih päih ta amdang vai ni cunsepi mei üng a bilawh lätki cun küikyannak yah khai.<verse eid="1CO 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 3:16"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 6:19">1Kor 6:19</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 6:16">2Kor 6:16</ref></char>
    </note>Nami k'uma Pamhnama Ngmüimkhya vekia kyase nangmi cun Pamhnama Templea nami kyaki ti cun nami ksingki. <verse eid="1CO 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 3:17"/>Pamhnama temple kpyehki a u pi, Pamhnam naw ani pi kpyeh hnga khai ni. Pamhnama temple cun ngcimcaihki kyase namimät kung pi acuna templea nami kyaki.<verse eid="1CO 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 3:18"/>Namimät käh mawngsak u. Nami ksunga mat naw hina khawmdek üng themkia a ngaih üng, a themnak law vaia ang ma se. <verse eid="1CO 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 3:19"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 5:13">Job 5:13</ref></char></note>Hina khawmdeka themnak cun Pamhnama ngaih a angnak ni. “Pamhnam naw khyang ktheme cun, ami mäta ksingnak am jah angsaki” tia a ng’yuki ni. <verse eid="1CO 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 3:20"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 94:11">Sal 94:11</ref></char></note>“Bawipa naw, khyang kthemea ngaihnak amdanga kyaki ti cun ksingki” tia pyenki. <verse eid="1CO 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 3:21"/>Acunakyase, aupi a bilawhnak thei üng käh awhcah kawm. A naküt hin Mhnama ka ni. <verse eid="1CO 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 3:22"/>Pawluha pi kyase, Apawluha pi kyase, Pitaa pi kyase, khawmdeka pi kyase, xünnaka pi kyase, thihnaka pi kyase, ve k'umkia pi kyase, ve law khaia pi kyase, avan nami ka ni, <verse eid="1CO 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 3:23"/>nangmi pi Khritawa ka kya lü, Khritaw pi Pamhnama ka ni.<verse eid="1CO 3:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1CO 4"/>
  <para style="s">Khritawa ngsä he</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 4:1"/>Keimi hin, Khritaw a mpya ja Pamhnama khyü ngthup pyen khaia Pamhnam naw a jah tak tia jah ngai kawm uki. <verse eid="1CO 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 4:2"/>Mpyaea phäh hlüki mat cun ami bawia vei sitih yah khaie. <verse eid="1CO 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 4:3"/>Nghngicima ningsaw ja nangmia ngthumkhyah cun kei naw ia am ngai veng. Kamät naw pi kamät ngthu am mkhyahei veng. <verse eid="1CO 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 4:4"/>Ka ngaihnak ngcim ve, acunsepi acun naw akcanga ka ngcimki tia am mdan. Ka khana ngthumkhyahki cun Bawipa amät ni. <verse eid="1CO 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 4:5"/>Acunakyase, Bawipa kcün am pha ham üng u pi ngthu käh mkhya pet ua, akpäihnaka ngthumkhyahnak cun Bawipa a law veia k'äih kawm. Ani naw nghmüp üng thup naküte cun akvai da jah law püi khai, mlung üng jah ngaihe pi jah mdang law khai, acuna mhnüp üng, khyang naküt naw ami mäta kyanaka, Pamhnama veia mküi yahei law khaie.<verse eid="1CO 4:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 4:6"/>Ka püie, nami phäha kei ja Apawluh nami jah ngtheinak vaia ka mtänga kyaki. Isetiüng nami jah ngcuhngkihnak vaia ni. Thum mat naw ta “ning jah upkie cän jah bükteng ua” tiki. Nangmi naw mat camcah na lü mat pi käh msetei ua. <verse eid="1CO 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 4:7"/>U naw nang ngvaia aning mcawn ni? Na tak naküt Pamhnam naw a ning peta am kyaki aw? Acune cun Pamhnam naw a ning peta kyase i vai na awhcahnaki ni?<verse eid="1CO 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 4:8"/>Nami hlüei naküt nami tapängki aw? Nami bawimang pängkie aw? Sangpuxangea nami kyaki aw? Keimi ta am kya veng u lüpi nangmi nami kya üngta a atänga sangpuxanga mi kya khaie. <verse eid="1CO 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 4:9"/>Pamhnam naw keimi ngsä he cun khawmdek khyange ja khankhawngsä he hmuh vaia khyang ksunga akhnu säiha thi khaia a jah tak ni. <verse eid="1CO 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 4:10"/>Khritawa phäha kami angki lüpi nangmi khritaw üng nami thengvaikie, keimi kthangcek lü nami ngjuktha üng nami beki. Nangmi khyang naw ning jah mhlünmtai lü keimi khyang naw jah hmumsitki. <verse eid="1CO 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 4:11"/>Tuh vei cäpa, cawixainak üng kami citcawn hüki. Suisak kdaw am kami taki, kpainak pi kami khamki, pung naküta kami citcawn hüki. <verse eid="1CO 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 4:12"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:3">Ngs 18:3</ref></char></note>Khüikhawm u ngüse kami suisaki, khyang naw a jah ksenak üng dawkyanak am kami kbeki; khyang naw a jah mkhuimkha üngka mi khameiki; <verse eid="1CO 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 4:13"/>ksekhanak kami kham üng akdawa kami jah msang beki. Khawmdeka phyawksak am kami tängeiki, tuhvei cäpa ia am kyakia kami veki.<verse eid="1CO 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 4:14"/>Isetiakyaküng ahin ka yuk law hin ning jah ngkeei hlüsak ngüse am ni. Ka ning jah mhlänak ka caea akba ning jah mcuhmtheh veng. <verse eid="1CO 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 4:15"/>Nami Khritjannak üng ning jah büktengki khawhah ve lü pi, pa mat däk nami taki. Nami veia thangkdaw ka lawpüi naw hina kcünsak üng Khritaw Jesuh üng nami yümmatkia kyase nami pa ka thawn lawki. <verse eid="1CO 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 4:16"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 11:1">1Kor 11:1</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 3:17">Phi 3:17</ref></char></note>Nami na ngcuhngkihnak vaia ning jah nghui na veng. <verse eid="1CO 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 4:17"/>Acunakyase, hina phäh kei naw Timoti ka tüih law ni. Ani cun khritjan kcünsak üng sitih lü ka mäta mhlänak Bawipa üng ka cakpa ni. Ani naw khaw naküt üng sangcime veia ka jah mthei ja Jesuh Khritaw üng pum matnaka xünnak ning jah mtheh be khai.<verse eid="1CO 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 4:18"/>Avang naw nami veia am ka law khaia ngaikiea kyase awhcahkie ni. <verse eid="1CO 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 4:19"/>Acunsepi, Bawipa naw, a ngjak'hlü ta, akjanga nami veia ka law khai; acunüng ami pyen däk am kya lü ka phäha nangmi üngka johit pi ka hmuh law khai. <verse eid="1CO 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 4:20"/>Pamhnama khyawngpe cun ngthu am kya, johita ni a kyak. <verse eid="1CO 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 4:21"/>Ini nami hlüei bawk? Kpaihcung am nami veia ka law khai aw?Ngmüimkhya Mhlänak ja mlunghnemnak am ka law khai aw?<verse eid="1CO 4:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1CO 5"/>
  <para style="s">Sangcima k'uma am ngcimcaihnak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 5:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 22:30">Deut 22:30</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nami ksunga hüipawmnak kyühkse akcanga veki tia ngthang hüki; acun hin khyang kcee üng pi am ve. Ami paa khyu kdik ihpüikie ti cun na mthehkie. <verse eid="1CO 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 5:2"/>Ihawkba nami awhcah khai ni. Acukba veki cun thüiseinak vai ni. Nami vei üngkhyüh pi ksät vai sü. <verse eid="1CO 5:2"/><verse number="3-4" style="v" sid="1CO 5:3-4"/>Ka pumsa am thuk lüpi Ngmüimkhya am nami hlawnga ka veki. Aksekhyua vekia khana Bawi Jesuh naw ngthumkhyah khaia kei naw pyen veng. Nangmi atänga nami nghmuh akba kei naw Ngmüimkhya am ka ning jah hmuh ngüse ni Bawi Jesuha johit naw atänga jah vepüiki. <verse eid="1CO 5:3-4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 5:5"/>Khyang acuna mäih cun a Ngmüimkhya Bawipa khaw mhnüp üng küikyannak a yah vaia, a pumsa khyükleih khaia Khawyama veia ap ua.<verse eid="1CO 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 5:6"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GAL 5:9">Kal 5:9</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nami awhcah hin am daw ve. Nghngen apica naw bu angkhä thawh saki ti am nami ksingki aw? <verse eid="1CO 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 5:7"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:5">Ex 12:5</ref></char></note>Mkhyenaka nghngen kphyüm cän loin ua, acukba ani üngva avana nami caih khai. Tuhta nghngen am ngcawki buh tawh üng nami täng khai. Nangmi cun akcanga nami ngcimki he ni. Mi lätnak pawi pi ngsäm hnüh ve, mi lätnak pawhnak vai Khritaw pi hnim päng ve u. <verse eid="1CO 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 5:8"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 13:7">Ex 13:7</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 16:3">Deut 16:3</ref></char></note>Acunakyase, mkhyekatnaka nghngnen akphyüm am kcawa muk am ni lü, nghngnen käh kcawa muk ngcimcaihnak ja ngthungtak am lätnak mi pawh vai u.<verse eid="1CO 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 5:9"/>Ka cayuk üng hüipawmkie käh nami jah ngpawngpüi vaia ka ning ja mthehki. <verse eid="1CO 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 5:10"/>Ka tinak hlü ta hüipawmkie, mpyukei he, juktuh hjawkhahkie käh jah ngpawngpüi ka tinak am ni. Khawmdek üng käh nami sängei vaia jah hjawng kung ua. <verse eid="1CO 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 5:11"/>Ka tinak hlü ta jumeikia ngsui lü hüipawmki, mpyuki, ngvawk pawhki, juktuh hjawkhahki, khyang hnimki, ju awki he cun atänga ngaw lü ei pi käh jah eipüi u.<verse eid="1CO 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12-13" style="v" sid="1CO 5:12-13"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:12-13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 13:5">Deut 13:5</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 17:7">17:7</ref> (LXX)</char>
    </note>Akcee ngthu jah mkhya pet vai cun keia bilawh vai am ni. Pamhnam naw jah mkhyah pe khai. Acunsepi namäta püie cun nami jah mkhya pe khai am ni aw? Cangcim naw a pyena kba “Am dawkia khyang nami ksung üngkhyüh jah ksät ua.”<verse eid="1CO 5:12-13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1CO 6"/>
  <para style="s">Am jummeikiea veia ngkhyaknak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 6:1"/>Jumeiki mat ja mat nami ngvawk üng, khyang ngcime veia am phapüi u lü, am jumeikiea veia nami phapüi khai aw? <verse eid="1CO 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 6:2"/>Pamhnama Khyange naw khawmdek ngthumkhyah khaie tia am nami ksingkie aw? Acukba anita khawmdek ngthumkya khaiea naw apimsüm ta am nami cijang thei khai aw? <verse eid="1CO 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 6:3"/>Khankhawngsä he pi ngthu jah mkhya pet vai am nami ksingkie aw? Acukba anita tuha kcün saka vekie cun ngthu am nami mkhya khai aw. <verse eid="1CO 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 6:4"/>Acubang a ve law üng sangcim üngka am kyakiea veia na cehpüi lü ngthu na mkhyahsak khai aw? <verse eid="1CO 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 6:5"/>Ngkehkhyakei veng! jumeiki mat ja mata lei mkhya khawh khai akthem matca pi nami ksunga am veki aw? <verse eid="1CO 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 6:6"/>Acukba am kya lü jumeiki mat naw jumeiki mat cun am jumeikia veia a lei a mkhya pet vaia cehpüiki.<verse eid="1CO 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 6:7"/>Jumeiki mat ja mat nami ngkhyakei hin am nami dawnak mdan ve. Aning jah hmakatsak, aning jah huhei cun am daw bawk khai aw? <verse eid="1CO 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 6:8"/>Acukba am kya lü nami mät naw mat ja mat hmakatsak lü jumeiki akceea ka pi nami jah huteiki. <verse eid="1CO 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 6:9"/>Am dawki he Pamhnama khyawngpe am pha u ti cun am nami ksingki aw? Nami mät naw nami mät käh mawgsak u; juktuh hjawkhahkie, khyanga khyu vepüikie, hüipawmkie, juktuh hjawkhahkie, kpami ja kpami ngkhyunglakie, <verse eid="1CO 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 6:10"/>mpyukie, hleikie, ju awki he, khyang ngvawk püikie, hleikie naküt cun Pamhnama khyawngpe am pha u. <verse eid="1CO 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 6:11"/>Nangmi avange pi acukba nami vekie; acunsepi, Bawipa Jesuh Khritawa ngming ja Pamhnama Ngmüimkhya üng ngthiei u lü nami ngcimcaih pängkie.<verse eid="1CO 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pumsa Pamhnam mhlünmtainaka sumei ua</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 6:12"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 10:23">1Kor 10:23</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Avan ka bi theiki” ti lü mat naw pyen khai, acunsepi, avan bilawh am daw; avan bi vai ka phäha kyaki ti lü ka pyen khai, acunsepi, kei cun acuna mpyaa am kya veng. <verse eid="1CO 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 6:13"/>Eiawk cun khawna phäha kya lü, khawn pi eiawka phäha kyaki; acunsepi, Pamhnam naw ani nghngih ja mkhyüh khai. Acunüng pumsa cun hüipawmnak vaia am kya lü Bawipa mhlünmtainak vai kyase pumsa hlüki cun Bawipa naw ja peki. <verse eid="1CO 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 6:14"/>Pamhnam naw Bawipa thihnak üngkhyüh mtho beki, mimi pi a johit am jah mtho be khai.<verse eid="1CO 6:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 6:15"/>Nami pumsae cun Khritawa ngbana kyakie tia nami ksingki. Khritawa mtisa cun lo lü am nghnumi ksea pumsaa ka pawh khai aw? Am kya! <verse eid="1CO 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 6:16"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:24">Gen 2:24</ref> </char></note>Nghnumi kse ihpüiki cun pumsa üng nghnumi am mata kyaki ti cun am nami ksingkie aw?” Nghngih cun mata kya khai” ti lü Cangcim naw pyenki. <verse eid="1CO 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 6:17"/>Bawipa üng ngpüilawki cun Ngmüimkhya lam üng Bawipa am mata kya khai.<verse eid="1CO 6:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 6:18"/>Hüipawmnak cän jeih u. Nghngicima mkhyekatnak hin pumsa kpung da kyaki; hüipawmnaka mkhyekatnak cun mäta pumsa mkhyekatnaka kyaki. <verse eid="1CO 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 6:19"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 3:16">1Kor 3:16</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 6:16">2Kor 6:16</ref> </char></note>Acunüng, nami pumsa cun Pamhnama ning jah pet, Ngmüimkhya ngcima Temple tia am nami ksingki aw? Nami mät naw nami mät am kana u lü Pamhnama a ning jah ka ni; <verse eid="1CO 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 6:20"/>A phu pe lü ning jah khyäih ni; acunakyase, nami pumsa Pamhnam mhlünmtainak vaia summang ua.<verse eid="1CO 6:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="1CO 7"/>
  <para style="s">Ngkhyunglanaka mawng ngthähnak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 7:1"/>Atuh nami yuka mawng üng sängki ka pyen khai. Kpami cun am a khyumah pi kdaw khai ni.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:1: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Kpami am a khyumah üng</char><char style="ft" closed="false">a ani üng</char><char style="fq" closed="false">Kpami khyumak ngkäih khaia a ve na ti üng. </char></note> <verse eid="1CO 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 7:2"/>Isetiakyaküng hüipawmnak vekia kyase kpami naküt khyu mah lü, nghnumi naküt pi cei mah kawm. <verse eid="1CO 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 7:3"/>Kpami naw pi kpamia bilawh vai bilo lü, nghnumi naw pi a bilawh vai bilo se, ngkhyungla xawi naw mat ja mata hlükaw cun kbe ni se. <verse eid="1CO 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 7:4"/>Nghnumi naw amäta pumsa am ka na, acunsepi a ceia phäha kyaki ni; acuna mäiha, kpami naw pi amäta pumsa am ka na, a khyua phäha kyaki. <verse eid="1CO 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 7:5"/>Atänga nami ktaiyünak vaia phäha mat jah mat käh ma lü nami ve khawia kba ve ni a. Acukba nami ve ta Khawyama hlawhlepnak üng nami ngxungei thei khai.<verse eid="1CO 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 7:6"/>Hin ka ning jah mtheh hin ngthupeta kba ka ning jah mtheha am kya, nami pawh vaia ka ning jah mtheh ni. <verse eid="1CO 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 7:7"/>Nangmi akcanga keia akba nami ve vai ka tängki. Acunsepi, khyang naküt üng Pamhnama pet am täng, mat ja mat ta yah am täng, mat naw akce ta lü mat naw akce taki.<verse eid="1CO 7:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 7:8"/>Tukbäih am ceimahkie ja hmeinuea veia ka pyen hlü ta, keia kba nami ve khawh ta daw bawk khai ni. <verse eid="1CO 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 7:9"/>Acunsepi, nami hlüeinak am nami üp thei ta khyungla ua; isetiakyaküng, mlunga khuikha kthaka ta khyumah hin daw säihki ni.<verse eid="1CO 7:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 7:10"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:10,11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 5:32">Mt 5:32</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 19:9">19:9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11">Mk 10:11</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 10:12">12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Lk 16:18</ref></char>
    </note>Ngkhyungla pängkiea veia ngthu jah pet hin ka mät naw ka jah pet am ni, Bawipa jah peta kyaki: Nghnumi naw a cei käh hawih lü; <verse eid="1CO 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 7:11"/>a hawih üng käh ceimah be kawm, am ani üng a cei ng’yäpüi be se, a cei naw pi käh ngtaipüi kawm.<verse eid="1CO 7:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 7:12"/>Khyang kcee veia kamäta pyen ta (Bawipa pyen am ni), jumeiki mat naw am jumeiki nghnumi a khyunak üng acun naw ve yüm khai xawia a bü üng käh hawih kawm. <verse eid="1CO 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 7:13"/>Acunüng, nghnumi naw am jumeiki a ceinak üng, a cei naw a hlawnga a ve vaia ngaih üng käh yawk kawm. <verse eid="1CO 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 7:14"/>Am jumeikia kpami cun a khyua phäha ngcimcaih lü, am jumeikia nghnumi pi a ceia phäha ngcimcaihki ni; acukba am ni vai sü ta nami cae am ngcim khaie sü; acunsepi ngcimki he ni. <verse eid="1CO 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 7:15"/>Nilüpi, am jumeiki naw Khritjan a püi a ngkya hlüpüi üng ngkyapüi kawm. Acubang üngta Khritjan kpami ja nghnumi cun ami ngaih sima kya khai. Pamhnam naw ngkhawtnak üng nami xüngsei khai a ning jah khü ni. <verse eid="1CO 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 7:16"/>Khritjan nghnumi aw, ihawkba na cei am na küikyan<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:16: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Küikyannak na yah vai ihawkba ngsing khai; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">am ani üng</char><char style="fq" closed="false">Küikyannak na yah vai ihawkba na ksing khai.</char></note> thei vai na ksingki ni? Khritjan kpami aw, ihawkba na khyu am na küikyan<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:16: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Küikyannak am na yah vai cun ihawkba na ngsing khai ni; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">am ani üng</char><char style="fq" closed="false">Küikyannak na yah vai ihawkba na ksing khai.</char></note> thei khai na ksingki ni?<verse eid="1CO 7:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pamhnama khüa kba xüngsei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 7:17"/>Pamhnam naw a ning jah khü üng a ning jah peta kba xüngsei u lü ve ua. Acukba sangcime naküt ka jah mtheiki. <verse eid="1CO 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 7:18"/>Khyang mat vun mawihnak kham pängki naw Pamhnama khünak a yah üng vun mawihnak cun käh mkhyüh se, vun am mawi hamki naw Pamhnama khünak a yah üng pi vun käh mawi hlü se. <verse eid="1CO 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 7:19"/>Khyanga vun mawih ja am mawih cun ia am kya, Pamhnama ngthupet naküt ngai ua. <verse eid="1CO 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 7:20"/>Pamhnama khünak nami yah üng nami vea mäiha ve u. <verse eid="1CO 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 7:21"/>Mpyaa nami kyak ham üng Pamhnam naw a ning jah khü ni. Ia käh ngai ua; lätnak vai akyak üng sumei ua.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:21: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">na lätnak vaia kcün a ve üng sumeia; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">am ani üng</char><char style="fq" closed="false">lüpi na lätnak vaia kcün a ve üngpi, akdawa ning vesak khai cän mpyaa kba xüeia.</char></note> <verse eid="1CO 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 7:22"/>Bawipa khüa mpya cun Bawipa mhläta khyanga kyaki; acukba bäa mpya am niki Khritaw naw a khü üng Khritawa mpya kyaki. <verse eid="1CO 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 7:23"/>A phu pe lü Pamhnam naw a ning jah khyäih ni; acunakyase khyanga mpyaa käh thawn be u. <verse eid="1CO 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 7:24"/>Ka püie, Pamhnam naw a ning jah khü üng nami ve khawia kba Pamhnam üng ngphunei ua.<verse eid="1CO 7:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Am Khyumahkie ja hmeinuea mawng ngthähnak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 7:25"/>Am khyumahkia mawng nami yuk lawnak üng, Bawipa ngthu peta am kya lü; Bawipa a mpyeneinak üng ümnak ngkäiha kyakia kyase, ka ngaih ka pyenki.<verse eid="1CO 7:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 7:26"/>Acunakyase, atuh khuikhanaka phäha, kpami amät a ve khawia kba a ve vai hin daw khaia ngai veng. <verse eid="1CO 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 7:27"/>Na khyu veki aw? Acun kba akyak üng käh ksäta. Am na khyumahki aw? Acukba akyak üng na khyu vai käh suia. <verse eid="1CO 7:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 7:28"/>Acunsepi, na khyumah üng na mkhyekatki am ni, am ceimah hamki nghnumi a ceimah üng pi mkhyekatkia am kya. Acunsepi, ngkhyunglakie naw amhnüp tä se khuikhanak ta bawki he ni, acukba nami ve vai am täng ve.<verse eid="1CO 7:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 7:29"/>Ka püie aw, ka pyen hlü cun akcün hin tawikia kyase, khyumahki pi, am khyumahkia kba ve kawm. <verse eid="1CO 7:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 7:30"/>Kyapkie pi am kyapkiea mäiha ve u se. Jeki pi am jekia mäiha ve kawm. Khawhthem khyäihktuki naw pi ami khyäih am takiea kba ve u se. <verse eid="1CO 7:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 7:31"/>Hina khawmdek khawhthem summangeiki pi am summangeikia mäiha ve u se. Isetiakyaküng hina khawmdek cun ivei am law lü xük law khaia kyaki.<verse eid="1CO 7:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 7:32"/>Cäicingnak üng nami lätlang vai hlüei veng. Am khyumahki naw Bawipa khut mcei lü a bi cun Bawipa jekyai hlüsak lü ni. <verse eid="1CO 7:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 7:33"/>Khyumahki naw a khyua jenak vai ngaih lü khawmdek lam cäi naki; <verse eid="1CO 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 7:34"/>acunakyase lam nghngih üng veki. Am ceimahki ja ngla naw cun pumsa ja Ngmüimkhya üng Bawipa khut bi khaia ngcuapei lü, ceimahkia nghnumi cun a cei a jekyaisak vai ngaih lü khawmdek lam cungaiki.<verse eid="1CO 7:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 7:35"/>Ahin ka pyen cun, isetikyaküng, ka ning jah kuei hlüa phäh ni. Ka ning jah mkhyawhnak am ni. Akdaw bilo lü ia sungkhamnak am ve lü Bawipa khut binak üng nami mät nami cuap vaia ka pyen ni.<verse eid="1CO 7:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 7:36"/>Ngkhyungla khai xawia mkhyäp päng te am ngkhyungla khai xawia ti beki xawia mawngma üng: kpami naw akdawa am a vecawhpüi üng a ngaihnak am nängei üngta khyumah kawm. Kakawngki xawia am kya.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:36</char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ngkhyungla xawi; a hlüei ta; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">am ani üng</char><char style="fq" closed="false">kpami ja am ceimah hamki a cangla: akdawa am a vecawhpüi lü a canglaa sak a xam hnüh üngta ceimahsak kawm.</char></note> <verse eid="1CO 7:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 7:37"/>Acunsepi, kpami naw am khyumah<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:37: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">käh ceimah khai; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">am ani üng</char><char style="fq" closed="false">a cangla am a ceimah hlüsak üng.</char></note> khaia a mlung khängsak lü amäta ngainak näng khaia bü lü acuna ngla am a khyunak üng ia am kya. Dawki ni.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:37: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">nglami a ceimah hlü üng</char><char style="ft" closed="false">am ani üng</char><char style="fq" closed="false">ceimah kawm.</char></note> <verse eid="1CO 7:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 7:38"/>Acunakyase, khyumah<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:38: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">ceimah; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">am ani üng</char><char style="fq" closed="false">a cangla ceimah se.</char></note> hin dawki, cunsepi am khyumah<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:38: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">käh ceimah; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">am ani üng</char><char style="fq" closed="false">käh ceimah kawm.</char></note> hin daw bawki ni.<verse eid="1CO 7:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 7:39"/>Ceimahkia nghnumi cun a ceia xüna k'um üngta a ceia phäha kyaki; acunsepi, a cei a thih käna a ngaiha khyang cei na khaia lätki ni. Acunsepi kpami a cei vai cun Bawipaa hnu kläka kya kawm. <verse eid="1CO 7:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 7:40"/>Acunsepi, keia ngaiha ta, am ceimah lü amät a ve üng jekyai bawk khai. Ahin ta ka mäta ngaih ni. Pamhnama Ngmüimkhya ka takia ka ngaiki.<verse eid="1CO 7:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="1CO 8"/>
  <para style="s">Juktuh hea veia peta ei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 8:1"/>Juktuh üng pet eia mawng ngthähnak nami yuk lawki. Mi van naw ksingnak mi taki. Acunsepi ksingkhyapnak naw jah awhcahsak lü, mhläkphyanak naw khyang jah sawngsaki.<verse eid="1CO 8:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 8:2"/>U pi i mä ksingkia ngaiki naw ami ksing vaia kba am ksing u.<verse eid="1CO 8:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 8:3"/>Acunsepi, Pamhnam mhläkphyanaki cun Pamhnam naw ksingki.<verse eid="1CO 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 8:4"/>Acunakyase, juktuha veia pet eiawka mawng cun: khawmdeka am ve xakia lupa phäh juktuh mcawmkie lüpi Pamhnam mat däk veki tia mi ksingki.<verse eid="1CO 8:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 8:5"/>Khankhawa pi kyase, mcea pi kyase, mhnam ngmingnakie mhnam khawhah bawi khawhah veki,<verse eid="1CO 8:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 8:6"/>mimia phäha ta Pamhnam mat däk, Pa mat veki, ani cun naw avan tüipyang lü ania phäha mi xüngki, Bawipa mat däk veki ani naw Jesuh Khritaw üngkhyüh anaküt mhnünmceng lü mimi pi mi xüngki.<verse eid="1CO 8:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 8:7"/>Acunsepi khyang avan naw hina ngthungtak am ksing u. Khyang avang naw juktuh xüngkia ngaikie. Acunakyase juktuha veia peta ei ami ei üng tuh vei cäpa juktuha eiawka ngaikie; ami ksingnak ngcekia kyase acun ami ei naw jah mtüihkhehsakia ngaihkie.<verse eid="1CO 8:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 8:8"/>Ei naw Pamhnama dä mi keha dawsakia am kya; am mi eia phäha i pi am mi sum na, mi eia phäh i pi am ni yahei na.<verse eid="1CO 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 8:9"/>Acunsepi, mcei ua, nami lätnak hin naw jumeinak ktha ngcekie käh jah kyukngtängsak se.<verse eid="1CO 8:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 8:10"/>Na ksingkia kyase, juktuh a venak templea na ei vai naw am ning ähei. Acunsepi akse ja akdaw a ksingnak am kyanki naw a ning hmu üng juktuha veia peta ei cun ei hnga khaia kyaki.<verse eid="1CO 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 8:11"/>Acunakyase a hama Khritaw thikia na bena cun na ksingnaka phäha khyük khaia kyaki.<verse eid="1CO 8:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 8:12"/>Benaea veia acuna mäiha mkhyekatnak pawh u lü, akse ja akdaw ami ksingnak ngcek se, nami mhlem üngta, Khritawa khana pi mkhyekatnak nami pawhki ni.<verse eid="1CO 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 8:13"/>Acunakyase, ka ei naw jumeiki kyukngtängsakia akyak üng, jumeiki am ka kyukngtängsak vaia ka xüna küt üng meh ka jeih khai.<verse eid="1CO 8:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="1CO 9"/>
  <para style="s">Ngsäa bilawhnak thei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 9:1"/>Kei lätlangki khyanga am ka kyaki aw? Angsäa am ka kyaki aw? Mi Bawipa Jesuh ka hmuh pängki am ni aw? Nangmi cun Bawipa khutbinaka ktheiha am nami kyakie aw? <verse eid="1CO 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 9:2"/>Akcee naw ngsäa am na ngai u se pi, nangmi naw nami na dokhamki; nami xünak Bawipa am pumata kyakia kyase nangmi cun ngsäa ka kyaknak msingnaka nami kyaki.<verse eid="1CO 9:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 9:3"/>Khyange naw ami na cijangei üng, kamät naw kamät ka ngxungeinak cun: <verse eid="1CO 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 9:4"/>Ka khutbia phäha ka eiaw khaia am kyaki aw?<verse eid="1CO 9:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 9:5"/>Bawipaa benae, ngsä kcee ja Pita naw a khyu aceh hüpüia kba ka hlawnga ka cehpüi hnga theikia am kyaki aw?<verse eid="1CO 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 9:6"/>Acunüng, kei ja Banabah däk khüi lü kami ei khaia aw?<verse eid="1CO 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 9:7"/>Yekape u naw pi ami mäta tungmang vai peei u lü ngtuk khaie aw? Lobikie naw ami mäta lo üngka capyit am ei khai aw? Tome sämki naw tomea cihtui am aw khai aw?<verse eid="1CO 9:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 9:8"/>A msuimcäpnake üng ka pät am khunkhih ngü, isetiakyaküng thum cun naw a ti kung ni a ti. <verse eid="1CO 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 9:9"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 25:4">Deut 25:4</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 5:18">1Tim 5:18</ref> </char></note>Mosia thum üng, “Cang lehki sea mpyawng käh na mkhüp vai” tia ng’yuki. Pamhnam naw se sawxat a pyen aw? <verse eid="1CO 9:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 9:10"/>Mimi phäha a pyena am kyaki aw? Mimia phäha a yuka kyaki. Lai kthawnki ja cang atki naw ami hama angtheipai äpki lü bi yahki xawi.<verse eid="1CO 9:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 9:11"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 15:7">Rom 15:7</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Keimi naw ngmüimkhya mci nami veia kami saw pängki. Nangmi üngka khawhthem khawha kami laki aw?<verse eid="1CO 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 9:12"/>Khyang kcee naw pi acuna mäih nangmi üng ami ngaihk’uh üng keimi naw ta acuna kthaka am kami ngaihk’uhei khai aw? Lüpi acukba bi vai cun am bi veng u. Khritawa Thangkdaw am kami kyawhnak vaia, kami khameikie ni. <verse eid="1CO 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 9:13"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 18:1">Deut 18:1</ref></char></note>Temple k'uma khüikie naw ami ei vai acuna k'umaka yah u lü, kpyawngkunga khüikie naw pi ngkengnaka yahkie tia am ksingkie aw? <verse eid="1CO 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 9:14"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:10">Mt 10:10</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:7">Lk 10:7</ref></char></note>Acuna mäiha ni, Thangkdaw sangkie cun, Thangkdaw üngkhyüh xüng khaie ti lü Bawipa naw ngthu jah peki.<verse eid="1CO 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 9:15"/>Acunsepi, kei ta acun kba am ve veng; ka khana acuna mäih nami pawhnak vaia hina ngthu ka yukia am kya; ka awhcahnak ia am ngtäh khaia khyang naw a pawha kdama ta, ka thih hngawh kyäp khai ni. <verse eid="1CO 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 9:16"/>Thangkdaw ka sanga phäh ka awhcahnak vai i am ve. Ka sang vaia kya kungki. Thangkdaw am ka sang üngta ka khana josetnaka kya khai. <verse eid="1CO 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 9:17"/>Kamät naw xü lü khut ka pawh üngka ngkhengnak ka yah khai; acunsepi Pamhnam naw a na apa bilawh vai kung ka biloki.<verse eid="1CO 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 9:18"/>I ni Ka hlawh ei? Ami na pet vai käh äpei lü thangkdaw ka pyen hin daw ve. Thangkdawa phäh ka yahei vai am pyen veng.<verse eid="1CO 9:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 9:19"/>Ua mpyaa pi am kya veng; cunsepi khyang khawhah ka yah vaia phäha kamät naw kamät khyangea mpyaa thawn veng.<verse eid="1CO 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 9:20"/>Judahea veia ka khüi üng Judahe ka jah yahnak vaia Judahea kba ka veki. Judahea veia ka khüih üng ka jah yahnak thei vaia ta Mosia thum am ka läk üng pi ka läkia kba ka veki.<verse eid="1CO 9:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 9:21"/>Khyangmjükceea veia ka khüi üng Judahea thum am ksingkia kba ka jah yahnak vaia khyangmjükceea kba ka veki. Ahikba ka ve hin Pamhnama thum am ka läkia am kya; kei cun Khritawa thuma keha ka veki ni.<verse eid="1CO 9:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 9:22"/>Ktha ngcekie ka jah yahnak vaia phäha ktha ngcekia mäiha ka veki. Acunakyase khyange ka jah yahnak thei vaia anaküta ka thawnki.<verse eid="1CO 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 9:23"/>Jodawnak ka yah hin jah yetnak be thei vaia, Thangkdawa phäha avan ka pawhki.<verse eid="1CO 9:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 9:24"/>Dawn ngcameinak üng khawhah dawngkie cunsepi mat däk naw ni ngkhengnak a yah kawm tia am nami ksingki aw? Ngkhengnak nami yah vaia dawng u. <verse eid="1CO 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 9:25"/>Dawngcameinak üng dawngki naküt naw ivei am khäng khaia lukhum ami yahnak vaia yet nakie, cunsepi mimi cun angläta khäng khaia lukhuma phäh mi kthanaki.<verse eid="1CO 9:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 9:26"/>Acunakyase dawng sawxatkia mäiha am ka dawngki; khawkhi thäk sawxatkia mäiha am ka ngthäki. <verse eid="1CO 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 9:27"/>Acunakyase, Thangkdaw khyangea veia ka sang hü üng am ami na hnepeinak vaia, ka pumsa ka nängeinak thei vaia ka kthanaki.<verse eid="1CO 9:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="1CO 10"/>
  <para style="s">Juktuha phäh mcäinak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 10:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:1: a </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 13:21">Ex 13:21</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 13:22">22</ref>; </char>
      <char style="xo" closed="false">b</char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 14:22-29">Ex 14:22-29</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ka püie, Mosia hnu läkie mi pupae ia kya khawikie ti cun nami süm vai hlüei veng. Amimi cun khawngmei naw jah ksung lü Mpanglaisen pi phyawn lü khekhamkie ni. <verse eid="1CO 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 10:2"/>Mosia hnu ami läka kba ami van khawngmei ja tui üng baptican khamkie. <verse eid="1CO 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 10:3"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 16:35">Ex 16:35</ref></char></note>Avan naw Ngmüimkhya ei atänga ei u lü, <verse eid="1CO 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 10:4"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 17:6">Ex 17:6</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 20:11">Num 20:11</ref></char></note>ami van naw Ngmüimkhya tui awki he ni; jah ngkhahpüikia Ngmüimkhya Lung üngka tüi awki he; acuna Lung cun Khritaw amät kung ni. <verse eid="1CO 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 10:5"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 14:29">Num 14:29</ref>,<ref loc="NUM 14:30">30</ref></char></note>Acunsepi, avangea khana Pamhnam am je se, khawkhyawng khawa thi u lü ami pumsa khyük päihki.<verse eid="1CO 10:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 10:6"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 11:4">Num 11:4</ref> </char>
    </note>Ahine hin mimi phäha msuimcäpnak ni, amimia bilawha kba am dawki käh bilawh vaia sitih jah peki, <verse eid="1CO 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 10:7"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 32:6">Ex 32:6</ref></char></note>juktuh ami sawhkhaha mäiha juktuh käh sawhkhah u. “Hüipawmnak ja eiawknaka pawia khyange ngawki he” tilü Cangcim naw pyenki.<verse eid="1CO 10:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 10:8"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 25:1-18">Num 25:1-18</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Avang he ami mkhyea kba käh mi mkhye khaie, mhnüp mat üng khyang tawng nghngih jah thawng kthum ami thiha mäiha käh mi ve vai u.<verse eid="1CO 10:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 10:9"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 21:5">Num 21:5</ref>,<ref loc="NUM 21:6">6</ref> </char>
    </note>Avang naw Khritaw cam u se, kphyu naw jah hnimki, cunakyase Bawipa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:9: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Bawipa; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">avang yuknake üngta</char><char style="fq" closed="false">Khritaw.</char></note> käh mi cam vai u.<verse eid="1CO 10:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 10:10"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 16:41-49">Num 16:41-49</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Avang he putcit u se thihnaka Ngsä naw a jah hnima mäiha käh mi ve vai u.<verse eid="1CO 10:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 10:11"/>Ahine cun akceea phäha msuimcäpnak vaia phäha ami veia kya lawki, cunsepi mimi phäha cingnak vaia ng’yuki ni. Mimi cun apäihnak law hlü hnüha kcün üng mi vekie ni.<verse eid="1CO 10:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 10:12"/>Khängkia nami ngdüikia nami ngaih üng käh nami kyuk vaia mcei ua.<verse eid="1CO 10:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 10:13"/>Nghngicima khamei thei hlawhlepnak ni nami khamei ta. Pamhnam a khyü mäki kyase, am nami khamei thei vaia hlawhlepnak nami khana am pha lawsak. Nami khameinak thei vaia hlawhlepnak üngka naw lätnak vaia lam pi ning pawh pet khai.<verse eid="1CO 10:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 10:14"/>Acunakyase, ka mhlänake aw, juktuh sawhkhahnak cun jeih ua.<verse eid="1CO 10:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 10:15"/>Khyang kthemea jah mtheha kba ning jah mtheh veng, i ka pyen ti cun ksing ua. <verse eid="1CO 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 10:16"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:26-28">Mt 26:26-28</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:22-24">Mk 14:22-24</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:19">Lk 22:19</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:20">20</ref></char></note>Bawipa Müeinaka Pamhnama veia jenak mi mtheh üng mi summangeia khawt: acuna khawt mi awk üng, Khritawa thisen mi awyümki, muk mi bo mi ei üng Khritawa pumsa mi yümeiki.<verse eid="1CO 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 10:17"/>Khyang khawjaha mi kyase pi, muk mat mi eiyüm üng pumsa mata mi kya lawki.<verse eid="1CO 10:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 10:18"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 7:6">Lev 7:6</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Isarel khyange jah teng süm u; Pamhnam üng ami peta ngkengnaka sa eikie cun naw phyawnkunga bilo yümkiea kyaki ni.<verse eid="1CO 10:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 10:19"/>Juktuha veia peta eiawk ja juktuh cun iyawa kya ve ka tiki aw?<verse eid="1CO 10:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 10:20"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 32:17">Deut 32:17</ref> (LXX)</char>
    </note>Ka! juktuha veia peta ngkengtainak cun Pamhnama veia peta am kya lü, khawyaiea veia peta ni akya ve, ka tiki ni. Khawyaia püipawa nami kya vai am hlüei veng.<verse eid="1CO 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 10:21"/>Bawipa khawt ja khawyaia khawt atänga am aw thei u ti; Bawipa kbe ja khawyaia kbe atänga am jah ei thei u ki. <verse eid="1CO 10:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 10:22"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:21">Deut 32:21</ref></char></note>Am ani üng, Bawipa mlung mi setsak khai aw? Mimi hin Bawipa kthaka mi kyan bawki aw?<verse eid="1CO 10:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 10:23"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:23: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 6:12">1Kor 6:12</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Avan pawh vaia nglawiki,” ami ti. Acun cun cang ve, cunsepi avan hin am daw. “Mimi cun avan mi pawh theiki” cunsepi avan cun mi phäha dawkia am kya.<verse eid="1CO 10:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 10:24"/>Nami hlüei käh sui u lü khyang kcea hlüei sui ua.<verse eid="1CO 10:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 10:25"/>Meh ami Jawihtuknaka ami jawih naküt mät ksingeinaka üng käh ngthäh u lü nami ei üng yahki. <verse eid="1CO 10:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 10:26"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 24:1">Sal 24:1</ref> </char></note>Cangcim naw, “Khawmdek jah khana vekie naküt cun Bawipa kaa kyakie ni,” tia pyenki.<verse eid="1CO 10:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 10:27"/>Am jumeiki naw buh na ei khaia a ning khüei üng, mät ksingeinak üng käh ngthäh lü a ning mbei naküt na ei sawxat vai.<verse eid="1CO 10:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 10:28"/>Khyang mat naw “Hin hin juktuh hjawkhanaka eiawk ni,” a ti üng, ning mthehkia phäha ja ksingeinaka phäh käh eia.<verse eid="1CO 10:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 10:29"/>Acun cun nanga ksingeinak am ni lü, khyang kcea ksingeinaka phäha kyaki. “Acunüng dawki,” Khyang mat naw, “Ise khyang kcea ksingeinak naw ka lätnak cun na khyawh pe khai ni? ti lü a ning kthäh üng,<verse eid="1CO 10:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 10:30"/>Ka eiawka phäha Pamhnama veia jenak ka pyen üng, ivai acuna eia phäh khyange naw na mseteikie ni?<verse eid="1CO 10:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 10:31"/>Daw ve, a i nami pawh üng pi, nami ei üng pi kyase, nami awk üng pi kyase Pamhnama hlüngtainak vaia avan pawh ua.<verse eid="1CO 10:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 10:32"/>Judahea pi kyase, Krikea pi kyase, Pamhnama sangcima pi kyase am nami jah kyukngtäsak vaia xüngsei ua.<verse eid="1CO 10:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 10:33"/>Ka bilawh naküt üng khyang ka jesak vaia ktha na lü ami lät vaia phäh ja ami daw vai cun ngai lü, kamäta dawnak vai am sui veng.<verse eid="1CO 10:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="1CO 11"/>
  <para style="s">Nghnumiea lu khüm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 11:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 4:16">1Kor 4:16</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 3:17">Phi 3:17</ref></char>
    </note>Khritaw üng ka ngtheia mäiha na ngthei na ua.<verse eid="1CO 11:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 11:2"/>Nangmi naw angläta na süm u lü ka ning jah mtheimthangnak he nami ja läklama phäha ning jah mküiei veng.<verse eid="1CO 11:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 11:3"/>Kpami hea lu cun Khritaw ni, nghnumia lu cun kpami ni, Khritawa lu cun Pamhnam ni tia nami ksing vai hlüei veng.<verse eid="1CO 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 11:4"/>Kpami a lu khüm lü ktaiyü lü ngthu pyenki cun Khritawa thangmsetki ni. <verse eid="1CO 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 11:5"/>Acunüng, nghnumi naw a lu am bu lü khyang ksunga Pamhnama ngthu a pyen üng a ceia thangmsetki ni, acukba akya üngta a lukkanga veki nghnumi üng am hngalang ni.<verse eid="1CO 11:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 11:6"/>Nghnumi naw a lu am a bu üngta a lu kteih kawm. Nghnumia phäh lu kteih cun seteinaka kyakia kyase a lu a bu vai. <verse eid="1CO 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 11:7"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:26">Gen 1:26</ref>,<ref loc="GEN 1:27">27</ref></char></note>Kpami naw a lu a bu vai am hlü, isetiakyaküng ani cun Pamhnama müihmai mdankia kyaki. Nghnumi cun naw kpamia müihmai mdanki.<verse eid="1CO 11:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 11:8"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:8,9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 2:18-23">Gen 2:18-23</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Kpami cun nghnumi üngkhyüh ngtüi lawkia am kya; nghnumi cun kpami üngkhyüh ngtüi lawkia kyaki.<verse eid="1CO 11:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 11:9"/>Kpami cun nghnumia phäha am kya lü nghnumi cun kpamia phäha kyaki. <verse eid="1CO 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 11:10"/>Khankhawngsä hea phäha nghnumi cun naw kpamia kea veki ti cun a mdannaka a lu bu kawm.<verse eid="1CO 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 11:11"/>Acunsepi Bawipa üng, kpami pi nghnumi kaa am cawm, nghnumi pi kpami kaa am cawm thei, ani nghngih mat jah mat hlüeiki xawi ni.<verse eid="1CO 11:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 11:12"/>Nghnumi cun kpami üngkhyüh a ngtüi lawa mäiha, kpami pi nghnumi üngka naw hmi lawkia kyaki, acunsepi, avan naküt cun Pamhnam üngka naw ngtüi lawki.<verse eid="1CO 11:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 11:13"/>Nami mät ngai ua, nghnumi naw a lü am khüm lü Pamhnama veia a ktaiyü hin nglawi ki aw? <verse eid="1CO 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 11:14"/>Kpami a lusam a sei üng hmuseki ti cun nami ksingeiki.<verse eid="1CO 11:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 11:15"/>Nghnumia lusam a sei cun a ngtonaka kyaki. A lusam cun a lu bunak vaia peta kyaki.<verse eid="1CO 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 11:16"/>Ahin cun Pamhnama sangcim avan üng thuma kyaki. Acunakyase nangmi üng u naw pi hina ka pyen cun a na ngcuhpüi vaia am kya.<verse eid="1CO 11:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Bawipa müei</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:26-29">Mt 26:26-29</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:22-25">Mk 14:22-25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-20">Lk 22:14-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 11:17"/>Hina mawng üng, sawkhah khaia nami ngcunak üng akdawa kthaka setsakia kyase am ning jah mküiei veng.<verse eid="1CO 11:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 11:18"/>Akcüka nami ngbämnak ning jah kehlankie veki tia ka ning jah mtheh päng ni. Acun hin avang cang khaia jum veng.<verse eid="1CO 11:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 11:19"/>Nami ksunga cangki a ngdangnak vaia ngpainak ve kung khai.<verse eid="1CO 11:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 11:20"/>Atänga ngcun law u lü nami ei cun Bawipa müei nami eikia am kya.<verse eid="1CO 11:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 11:21"/>Nami ei üng nami mäta ka nami eikia kyase avang jah khyawtei se avang eiaw ktatkie.<verse eid="1CO 11:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 11:22"/>Eiawknak vai im am nami takie aw? Am acunüng Pamhnama sangcim hmumsit u lü, i am takie nami jah ngkeeisakie aw? Ahina phäha i ka pyen vai nami ngjak'hlüki ni? Ning jah mküiei vai aw? Am ning jah mküiei veng.<verse eid="1CO 11:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 11:23"/>Ngthu ka ning jah mtheh hin Bawipa üngka ka yah ni: acun kba Bawipa Jesuh naw ami jawiheia mthan üng muk lo lü,<verse eid="1CO 11:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 11:24"/>Pamhnama veia Jenaka ngthu pyen lü, boki naw, “Hin hin nami phäha ka pumsa ni. Nami na sümnak vaia ahin hin pawh ua,” a ti.<verse eid="1CO 11:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 11:25"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:25:a </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 24:8">Ex 24:8</ref>; <ref loc="JER 31:31-34">Jer 31:31-34</ref>; </char>
      <char style="xo" closed="false">b</char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 24:6-8">Ex 24:6-8</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Acukba Müei ami ei käna, khawt lo lü “Hina khawt cun ka thisen am msinga ngthumkhän kthaia kyaki. Nami awk naküt üng nami na sümnak nglät vaia pawh ua,” a ti.<verse eid="1CO 11:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 11:26"/>Ahina muk ei u lü, khawt nami awk naküt üng Bawipa a law be vei cäpa a thihnak nami sangki tinaka kyaki ni.<verse eid="1CO 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 11:27"/>Acunakyase, a u pi, am nglawi xa se muk ei lü Bawipa khawt awki cun Bawipa pumsa ja a thisen mkhyekatnakia kyaki.<verse eid="1CO 11:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 11:28"/>Acunakyase a u naw pi, muk ja khawt üngka a eiawka kcük üng amät naw amät ksükcetei ma kawm.<verse eid="1CO 11:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 11:29"/>Bawipa a pumsaa suilam am ksing lü muk ei lü khawt üngka na awk üng, na mäta khana ngthumkhyahnak cun na eiawknak am na phaei law saki ni.<verse eid="1CO 11:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 11:30"/>Acunakyase ni avange am yai u lü, avange jah mhnatei se, khawjah thikie.<verse eid="1CO 11:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 11:31"/>Akcüka mimät naw mimät mi ksükcetei kyu üng Pamhnama ngthumkhyahnaka keha am mi pha.<verse eid="1CO 11:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 11:32"/>Bawipa naw ngthu jah mkhyah lü a jah mkhuimkha cun, khawmdek am atänga am a jah mkateinak vaia a jah yuhnaka kyaki ni.<verse eid="1CO 11:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 11:33"/>Acunakyase, ka püie, Bawipa müei nami ei khaia atänga nami ngcun law üng nami püi k'äih ua.<verse eid="1CO 11:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 11:34"/>Nami ngcun law üng Pamhnama ngthumkhyahnak am nami khameinak vaia, ei nami cawi üng nami ima nami ei vai sü. Akcea phäha ta ka law be üng ka ning jah mthehei law khai.<verse eid="1CO 11:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="1CO 12"/>
  <para style="s">Ngmüimkhya Ngcima bänake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 12:1"/>Ka püie, Ngmüimkhya bänaka mawng nami yuk lawki. Akcanga ahine nami jah ksing vai hlüei veng.<verse eid="1CO 12:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 12:2"/>Am nami jumei ham üng juktuh akthie sawhkhah khaia lam ning jah hmesak ve u.<verse eid="1CO 12:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 12:3"/>Acunakyase, Pamhnama Ngmüimkhya naw am a cehpüia khyang naw, “Jesuh ksekha na khai” acunüng, Ngmüimkhya ngcima lam sümnak am taki naw, “Jesuh cun Bawipa ni” tia am pyen thei ti cun ning jah ksingsak veng.<verse eid="1CO 12:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 12:4"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 12:6-8">Rom 12:6-8</ref> </char>
    </note>Ngmüimkhya bänak akce kce veki, cunsepi, Ngmüimkhya mat däka kyaki. <verse eid="1CO 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 12:5"/>Khutbi akce kce veki, cunsepi, Bawipa cun mata kyaki.<verse eid="1CO 12:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 12:6"/>Bilawhnak thei akce kce veki, cunsepi, bilawhnak thei jah peki Pamhnam mat däka kyaki.<verse eid="1CO 12:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 12:7"/>Ngmüimkhya khyang mat cia k'uma a ve cun avan mi dawnak vaia phäha kyaki ni.<verse eid="1CO 12:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 12:8"/>Ngmüimkhya naw Khyang akcea veia themnaka ngthu pe lü, acuna Ngmüimkhya kung naw khyang akcea veia ngthu ksingkhyapnak peki.<verse eid="1CO 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 12:9"/>Acuna Ngmüimkhya bä naw khyang akcea veia jumeinak pe lü, khyang akcea veia yainak be theia johit peki.<verse eid="1CO 12:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 12:10"/>Ngmüimkhya naw khyang akcea veia müncankse bilawhnaka johit pe lü khyang akcea veia Pamhnama ngthu pyensaknak thei peki. Mata veia Ngmüimkhya üngka naw lawkia bänak ja akce üngka naw lawkia bänaka hngalangnak ksingnak peki. Khyang akcea veia ngthu akce kce pyen theinak pe lü akcea veia acuna ngthua suilam pyenak be thei peki.<verse eid="1CO 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 12:11"/>Acunsepi khyang avana khana acune jah pawhki cun Ngmüimkhya mäta kyaki; amäta hlüa kba khyang mat cia veia bänak akce kce jah peki.<verse eid="1CO 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pumsa mat üng kphyem khawhah</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 12:12"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 12:4">Rom 12:4</ref>,<ref loc="ROM 12:5">5</ref></char>
    </note>Khritaw cun ngban khawhah lawkia pumsa mata kba kyaki; Ngban khawhah am pyana kyase pi pumsa mata kyaki.<verse eid="1CO 12:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 12:13"/>Acun kba ni avan hin Judaha pi kyase, Krika pi kyase, mpyaa pi kyase, mpya am ni tia pi kyase, pumsa mat üng mi ve khaia Ngmüimkhya mat üng baptican mi khanki. Ngmüimkhya mat däk awk vaia jah peki.<verse eid="1CO 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 12:14"/>Pumsa cun ngban mat dänga pyana am kya, ngban khawhah üng pyana kyaki.<verse eid="1CO 12:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 12:15"/>Khaw naw “Kuta am ka kyakia kyase pumsa üng am ngpüi veng” a ti üng acuna phäha pumsa üng am ngpüikia am kya.<verse eid="1CO 12:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 12:16"/>Acunüng, nghnga naw, “Mika am ka kyakia kyase pumsa üng am ngpüi veng” a ti üng, acuna phäha pumsa üng am ngpüikia am kya.<verse eid="1CO 12:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 12:17"/>Pumsa avan cun mika akya päih vai sü ta ihawkba mi ngja khai ni? Avan ngjaknaka akya vai sü ta ihawkba ahawi mi ksing khai ni?<verse eid="1CO 12:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 12:18"/>Acukba Pamhnam naw am tängkia pumsa ngbane cun a ngjakhlüa a jah tak ni.<verse eid="1CO 12:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 12:19"/>Avan ngban mata mi kya päih üng, pumsa vai am ve.<verse eid="1CO 12:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 12:20"/>Hin kba kyaki, ngban khawhah law se pi pumsa mat däka kyaki.<verse eid="1CO 12:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 12:21"/>Acunüng, mik naw kuta veia, “Am ning ngjahlü veng” am ti thei; lu naw pi khawa veia, “Ä, am ning ngjahlü veng” am ti thei.<verse eid="1CO 12:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 12:22"/>Pumsa üng akjaw säiha mi ngaih am ngpüi xase i am mi pawh thei.<verse eid="1CO 12:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 12:23"/>Acunakyase, pumsa üng am mawngkia mi jah ngaiha ngbane ni mi jah künak säih; pumsa üng am dawkia mi jah hmuhe ni mi jah cäinak säih.<verse eid="1CO 12:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 12:24"/>Dawkia ngbane cun jah dawsak vai am hlü ti u. Pamhnam amät naw am tängkia ngbane pumsa üng a jah tak hin mata hlü cun mat naw am mcei lü a leisawng vaia phäh ni.<verse eid="1CO 12:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 12:25"/>Pumsa üng ngpainak am ve, cunsepi am tängkia ngbane naw ami püi mceiei khaie.<verse eid="1CO 12:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 12:26"/>Acunakyase, ngban mata khuikha üng ngban naküt khuikha hngakie; ngban mat mküiei üng jekyainak cun avan naw yahkie.<verse eid="1CO 12:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 12:27"/>Avan Khritawa pumsaa nami kyaki, mat ci cun a ngbana nami kyaki.<verse eid="1CO 12:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 12:28"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:28: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EPH 4:11">Eph 4:11</ref> </char>
    </note>Pamhnama sangcim üng avan cun hnün a jah pet: akcüka ngsä he, anghnihnaka sahmae, akthumnaka jah mtheimthangkie; acun käna müncankse pawhkie; acun käna jah m’yai be theikie, acunüng khyang kpüikpakie, acunüng lam kdaw jah msüm theikie ja ngthu kce pyen theikia kyakie.<verse eid="1CO 12:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 12:29"/>Khyang avan cun ngsä he, sahmae ja jah mtheimthangkiea am kya u. Avan naw müncankse pawhnak am ta u;<verse eid="1CO 12:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 12:30"/>Avan naw hlikhaüa pawh m’yai be theikiea am kya. Avan naw ngthu akce kce pyen theikia am kya. Avan acuna ngthua suilam pyen be theikia am kya.<verse eid="1CO 12:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 12:31"/>Akdaw säih yah vai ja nami mlung üngta ua. Akdaw säih lam ka ning jah hmuh khai.<verse eid="1CO 12:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="1CO 13"/>
  <para style="s">Mhläkphyanak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 13:1"/>Khyang naküta ngthukhyü pyen thei lü khankhaw ngsä hea ngthukhyü pi pyen thei ngü se pi, mhläkphyanak am ka tak üngta, ng'yüng sawxatkia pung ja ng'yüng sawxatkia kcinga mäiha ni ka law kawm.<verse eid="1CO 13:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 13:2"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 17:20">Mt 17:20</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 21:21">21:21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:23">Mk 11:23</ref></char>
    </note>Ngthu pyennak thei, ngthu ngthup naküt ksingkhyapnak ta lü; mcung pi akcea ngpyawt thei khai hlawka jumnak tak üng pi; mhläkphyanak am ka tak üngta kei amdang vai ni.<verse eid="1CO 13:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 13:3"/>Ka tak naküt jah yet hü lü ka pumsa pi mei üng mkhih vai hlawka ve ni se pi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:3: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Mkhih vai; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">avang yuknake naw</char><char style="fq" closed="false">awhcahak vaia.</char></note> mhläkphyanaka am ka tak üngta acukba pawh cun naw i pi am na dawsak.<verse eid="1CO 13:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 13:4"/>Mhläkphyanak cun mlung msaünak ja dawnaka kyaki; Ani cun awhcahnak, ng’eihnak ja pakhyapnaka am kya.<verse eid="1CO 13:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 13:5"/>Mhläkphyanak cun angnei am kse, a mäta malam am sui, am mlung am so; mhläkphyanak naw khyang mhlätki;<verse eid="1CO 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 13:6"/>mhläkphyanak cun akse üng am je, cunsepi ngthungtak üng jekyaiki.<verse eid="1CO 13:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 13:7"/>Mhläkphyanak cun am bawngka thei; jumei theiki, äpei theiki, angläta k'äihei theiki.<verse eid="1CO 13:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 13:8"/>Mhläkphyanak cun ngläta kyaki. Ngthu sangnak, ngthu akce kce pyennak thei, ksingnak theie cun ve u se pi asäng üng päih law khaie.<verse eid="1CO 13:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 13:9"/>Am kümkawi khaia mi ksingki, ngthu pi avang ni kami sangki.<verse eid="1CO 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 13:10"/>A kümkawinak a pha law üng, am kümkawiki cun düt lawsaka khai.<verse eid="1CO 13:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 13:11"/>Ka hnasen ham üng ka pyen, ka ngaih ja ka bilawhe cun hnasena kba kyaki; cunsepi atuh ta ka däm lawki kyase hnasena kba am kya ti veng.<verse eid="1CO 13:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 13:12"/>Atuh cun hman üng mi müihmai am ngkhaiki mi hmuha mäih kyaki; ngawia ta angsinga mi hmuh law khai. Atuh ka ksing cun avang ni; cunsepi Pamhnama ksingkhyapnak kei üng a küma kba aküma ka ksing law khai.<verse eid="1CO 13:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 13:13"/>Atuh cun jumeinak, äpeinak ja mhläkphyanak kthum vekie. Ahina kthume üng mhläkphyanak hlüng säihki.<verse eid="1CO 13:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="1CO 14"/>
  <para style="s">Ngmüimkhya üngka bänakea mawng</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 14:1"/>Mhläkphyanak cun ktha na ua. Ngmüimkhyaa bänake üng nami mlungmthin jah ta ua, aktunga Pamhnama ngthu sang theia bänak cun tak vaia ktha na ua.<verse eid="1CO 14:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 14:2"/>Am ksinga ngthu pyenkie cun u naw ami pyen am ksingkia kyase khyanga veia käh pyen u lü Pamhnama veia pyenkiea kyaki. Ngmüimkhya johit üng ngthu ngthup cun pyenkie ni.<verse eid="1CO 14:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 14:3"/>Ngthu sangkie cun, khyanga dawnak vaia ngthu, mcäinaka ngthu ja mhlawhmcahnaka ngthu pyenkie.<verse eid="1CO 14:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 14:4"/>Am ksing theia ngthu pyenkie cun ami mäta dawnak vaia kyaki, acunsepi Pamhnama ngthu sangkie cun naw sangcimea dawnak vaia pyenkie ni.<verse eid="1CO 14:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 14:5"/>Acunüng nami van naw am ksing theia ngthu nami pyen thei vai ka hlüeiki, acunsepi ngthu nami sangnak vaia bäkhäknak cun hlüei bawk veng; ngthu kce pyenkia kthak Pamhnama ngthu sangki cun phumah ve, ngthu pyenkia phäh lat be khai a ve ta sangcim daw khai ni.<verse eid="1CO 14:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 14:6"/>Ka püie, nami veia ka law üng am ksinga ngthu pyen lü ka law üng ia ka kya khai. Ia am kya, Pamhnama mdannak, ksingnak, dawkia khyübe ja mtheinak ka lawpüi üngpi ia am kya.<verse eid="1CO 14:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 14:7"/>Am xüngsekie pilim ja cawng pi akdaw am ami ng'yünko ta a tuilam am ksingki naw ihawkba jah ksing thei khai ni?<verse eid="1CO 14:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 14:8"/>Ngtuk pawh vai üng kpun ami tum, am mi ngsinga a ng'yüng am ksing üng ngtuk pawh khaia u ngpitngpyang khai ni?<verse eid="1CO 14:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 14:9"/>Acuna mäiha, am ksinga ngthu üng pyen cun ihawkba khyange naw ksing khaie ni? Khawkhi üng pyen sawxata mäiha law khai.<verse eid="1CO 14:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 14:10"/>Khawmdek khana ngthukhyü akce kce veki, acunsepi ami van ami ti hlü veki.<verse eid="1CO 14:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 14:11"/>Ami pyen am ka ksing üng acun pyenki cun keia phäha khyangmjü kcea kya lü kei pi amimi phäha khyangmjü kcea ka kya khai.<verse eid="1CO 14:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 14:12"/>Acunakyase, nangmi pi Ngmüimkya bänak tak vaia nami kthanaka mäiha; sangcima ngdüih thawhnak vaia acune jah sumei vaia ktha na däm ua.<verse eid="1CO 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 14:13"/>Am ksing theia ngthu pyenki naw i a pyen ti cun a jah mtheh be thei vaia ktaiyü se.<verse eid="1CO 14:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 14:14"/>Am ksing theia ngthu üng ka ktaiyü üng, ka ngmüimkhya akcanga ktaiyüki, cunsepi ka mlung naw am sim.<verse eid="1CO 14:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 14:15"/>Acukba anita i ja ka pawh kawm? Ka ngmüimkhya am ka ktaiyü khai, ka ksingnak am pi ka ktaiyü khai; ka ngmüimkhya am ng’äi lü ka mlung kyawng am pi ka ng’äi hnga khai.<verse eid="1CO 14:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 14:16"/>Ngmüimkhya däk am Pamhnama vei jenak na mtheh üng, jenak mtheh lü na ktaiyü cun am ksingkie naw ihawkba “Amen” ti thei khaie ni.<verse eid="1CO 14:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 14:17"/>Pamhnam üng jenak mtheh lü na ktaiyü cun aktäa dawki cunsepi khyang kcee naw am daw na u.<verse eid="1CO 14:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 14:18"/>Nangmi kthaka am ksinga ngthu ka pyen bawka phäh Pamhnam je na veng.<verse eid="1CO 14:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 14:19"/>Acunsepi, sangcimea sawkhanaka am ksing theia ngthu thawng mat pyen na kthaka ta, khyangea ksing theia ngthu nglung mhma ka sumei khai ni.<verse eid="1CO 14:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 14:20"/>Ka püie, nami cungaihnak üng hnasen hea kba käh ve ua; cungaihnak am xü u lü mkhyekatnak am ksingkia hnasena mäiha ve ua.<verse eid="1CO 14:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 14:21"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 28:11">Hesa 28:11</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 28:12">12</ref></char>
    </note>Thum üng, “khyangmjü kcea khyü üng ka khyange ka jah ngthungmin püi khai; khyangmjü kcea mpyawng üng ka khyange ka jah ngthungmin püi khai, acunüng pi ka khyange naw am na ngai khaie” tia ng’yuki.<verse eid="1CO 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 14:22"/>Acunakyase, am ksing theia ngthu pyen cun jumeikiea phäha msingnaka am kya, am jumeikiea phäha ni a kya ve; ngthu sangnak cun am jumeikiea phäha msingnaka am kya, jumeikiea phäha ni a kya ve.<verse eid="1CO 14:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 14:23"/>Acunakyase, sangcime naküt ngcun u lü, nami van naw am ksinga khyü am ngthu nami pyen üng, am ksingkie ja am jumeikie ami law üng, nami angkia am ning jah ngai khaie ni?<verse eid="1CO 14:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 14:24"/>Acunsepi, sangcime nami van ngthu sang u lü nami na ve k'um üng, am jumeikia pi kyase, khyang sawxata pi kyase, a luh law üng ami ngjaka ngthu naw ami mkhyekatnak jah ksingsak khai. Ami ngjak naw ami katnak ngthu jah mkhyah khai.<verse eid="1CO 14:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 14:25"/>Ami mlungkyawng k'uma anghmüa ami ngaihkyunake mdana kya khai, kawp u lü Pamhnam sawhkhah khaie; “Pamhnam hia ve kcang ve” tia pyen khaie.<verse eid="1CO 14:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Sangcim k'uma ngitawkia bilawhnak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 14:26"/>Ka püie aw, ka ti hlü ta hikba ni. Hjawhkhah khaia nami ngkhäm law üng, mat ng’äi khai, mat naw mtheimthangnak, mat naw Pamhnam üngkhyüh mdannak, mat naw am ksing theia khyü pyenak, mat naw acuna khyü ti cun lat be yah khai. Avan cun sangcima dawnak vaia kya khaie.<verse eid="1CO 14:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 14:27"/>Am ksing theia ngthu üng pyenki a ve üng, nghngih ja anung säih kthum ami ve üng, mat päng lü mat naw pyen yah khai. Acuna ani pyen cun pi mat mat naw lat be yah khai.<verse eid="1CO 14:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 14:28"/>Lüpi acuna lat be khai am a ve ta sangcima k'uma käh khihkheh kawm, amät naw Pamhnam ngthueipüi kawm.<verse eid="1CO 14:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 14:29"/>Nghngih kthum Pamhnama ngthu yahki naw ami pyen um üng akce naw i ami pyen ti cun jah ksükcet kawm.<verse eid="1CO 14:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 14:30"/>Ngkämnaka mat naw Pamhnam üngkhyüh ngthu a yah ta am ksinga ngthu pyenki naw a pyen hawih se.<verse eid="1CO 14:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 14:31"/>Avan naw Pamhnama ngthu mat mat cima nami sang yah khai acun üng ni avan naw ngthei na u lü ngjuktha pi yah khaie.<verse eid="1CO 14:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 14:32"/>Pamhnama ngthu pyennak thei bänak yahki cun ngthu pyenkia keha ve yah vai,<verse eid="1CO 14:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 14:33"/>isetiakyaküng Pamhnam naw amimi akse mi ve vai am hlüei, mi ngkawt vai ja mi dim’yeki vai hlüeiki. Pamhnama sangcim avan ami ngkhäm üng,<verse eid="1CO 14:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 14:34"/>nghnumie ngkhämnaka käh khihkheh lü ve u se; Judahea thum naw a pyena kba; käh jah ksenak vai jah phäh käh ngthuei u se.<verse eid="1CO 14:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 14:35"/>I mä ami ksing hlü üng pi ami cei ima kthäh u se. Sangcima ngkhämnaka nghnumia ngthu pyen cun ngkekhyakei phyaki ni.<verse eid="1CO 14:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 14:36"/>Pamhnama ngthu cun nangmi üngkhyüh lawki aw? Am ani üng nangmia vei däka pha lawki aw?<verse eid="1CO 14:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 14:37"/>A u pi, Pamhnama ngsäa am ani üng Ngmüimkhya bänaka a ngaih üng, ani naw a ksing vaia Bawipa ngthupet cun ania veia ka yuk ni.<verse eid="1CO 14:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 14:38"/>Hina ka yuk ia am msuiki cun ani pi ia käh msui ua.<verse eid="1CO 14:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 14:39"/>Acunakyase ka püie, Pamhnama ngthu sang da nami mlung ktha na u; am ksinga ngthu pyenki pi käh mkhyawh u.<verse eid="1CO 14:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 14:40"/>Anaküt cun akdawa tui lam üng bilo ua.<verse eid="1CO 14:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="1CO 15"/>
  <para style="s">Khritawa thawhnak be</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 15:1"/>Ka püie aw, Thangkdaw ka ning jah mtheh ning jah ksingsak be veng, acuna Thangkdaw dokham u lü, nami jumnak acuna khana angkhänga ngdüiki.<verse eid="1CO 15:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 15:2"/>Ka ngthu sang cän nami jum sawxatkia am kya lü, nami läklam kcangkia akyak üng, acun bä üng küikyana nami kyaki.<verse eid="1CO 15:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 15:3"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 53:5-12">Hesa 53:5-12</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ka yah nami veia ka ning jah peki, acun cun sayü lü däm säihki ni, Khritaw cun mi mkhyekata phäh thiki tia Cangcim üng ng’yuki,<verse eid="1CO 15:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 15:4"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 16:8-10">Sal 16:8-10</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:14">Mt 12:14</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 2:24-32">Ngs 2:24-32</ref> </char>
    </note>ani cun ami k’ut, amhnüp kthum üng tho law beki tia Cangcim üng ng’yuki ni.<verse eid="1CO 15:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 15:5"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:5:a </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 24:34">Lk 24:34</ref>; </char>
      <char style="xo" closed="false">b</char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 28:16">Mt 28:16</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 28:17">17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14">Mk 16:14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36">Lk 24:36</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19">Jn 20:19</ref></char>
    </note>Pita veia ngdang law lü, acun käna xaleinghngihea veia ngdangki.<verse eid="1CO 15:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 15:6"/>Acun käna bena, phyamhmaa kthaka nungki veia ngdang lawki, khawhah cun tuhkbäih veia xüng hamkie, avange cun thi pängkie ni.<verse eid="1CO 15:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 15:7"/>Acun käna Jakuka veia ngdangki, acun käna ngsä he naküta veia ngdangki.<verse eid="1CO 15:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 15:8"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 9:3-6">Ngs 9:3-6</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ak’hnu säiha, keia vei pi ngdang lawki, kei cun am kha se hmi lawkia mäih ni ka law ta.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:8: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">A hmi law am hmanki; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">am ani üng</char><char style="fq" closed="false">akcün a set üng hmi lawki.</char></note><verse eid="1CO 15:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 15:9"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 8:3">Ngs 8:3</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Kei cun ngsä he ksunga ka dik säihki, Pamhnama sangcime ka jah mkhuimkhakia kyase, ngsäa pi am ka nglawi kyawki va.<verse eid="1CO 15:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 15:10"/>Cunsepi, Pamhnama bäkhäknak am ahikba ka kyaki; a bäkhäknak amdanga a na pet cun ni, ngsä kcea kthaka ktha na bawk lü ka khüikhawmki. Acukba ka kthanak bawk cun kamäta kthanaka am kya, Pamhnama bäkhäknak naw kei üng khut pawhki.<verse eid="1CO 15:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 15:11"/>Acukba ani üng, keia khyüh kyase, amimia khyüh pi kyase, ahin kung kami pyenki, nangmi naw pi ahin kung nami jumki.<verse eid="1CO 15:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mi thawhnak be</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 15:12"/>Atuha kami ngthu cun Khritaw thihnak üngkhyüh thobeki tia kyase, ise nangmi üng avange naw, “Khyang kthia thawhnak be am ve,” nami tiki ni?<verse eid="1CO 15:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 15:13"/>Khyang kthia thawhnak be am a ve üng Khritaw pi am tho law be khai sü;<verse eid="1CO 15:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 15:14"/>acunüng, Khritaw tho law bekia am akyak üng kami ngthu sang amdanga kya lü nami jumnak pi amdanga kya khai ni.<verse eid="1CO 15:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 15:15"/>Acunüng, Pamhnam hleikia mi mdankia ni akya, isetiakyaküng, Khritaw cun Pamhnam naw mtho beki mi tia phäh ni, ahin akcang ta thikie sak xünnaka am tho be u. Pamhnam naw pi Khritaw am mtho be.<verse eid="1CO 15:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 15:16"/>Khyang kthie, am ami thawh law be üng Khritaw pi am tho law be;<verse eid="1CO 15:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 15:17"/>acunüng, Khritaw am a thawh law be ham üng nami jumnak pi amdanga kya lü nami mkhyekatnak üng khyük lü nami thi hamkie ni.<verse eid="1CO 15:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 15:18"/>Acukba akyak üng Khritaw üng thi pängkiea jumeikie pi khyük khaie ni.<verse eid="1CO 15:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 15:19"/>Tuhkbäih mi xün k'um däk üng Khritawa khana äpeinak mi ta lü akcea saka phäh am akyak üng<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:19:</char><char style="fq" closed="false">Khritaw üng äpeinak mi tak hin tuha kcüna phäh daw lü akcea phäh am akyak üng; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">am ani üng</char><char style="fq" closed="false">tuha sak üng vekia Khritaw üng mi äpeinak hin.</char></note> khawmdeka veki khyange kthaka jah mpyeneinak yahei bawk khaia mi nglawiki.<verse eid="1CO 15:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 15:20"/>Acunsepi, Khritaw cun thihnak üngka naw tho law be kcang lü, ipkie pi tholaw be khaie tia msingnak ni.<verse eid="1CO 15:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 15:21"/>Nghngicim khyanga phäha thihnak a ve lawa mäiha, nghngicim khyanga phäh kunga khyang kthia thawh lawnak be ve lawki.<verse eid="1CO 15:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 15:22"/>Adam üng khyang naküt ami thiha kba Khritaw üng khyang naküt tho be khai.<verse eid="1CO 15:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 15:23"/>Acunsepi, khyang mat cim ami kcün üng tho khaie; Khritaw cun akcüka tho be khai. Acun käna Khritawa law be üng ani taki tho law be khaie.<verse eid="1CO 15:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 15:24"/>Acun käna apäihnak pha law khai; Khritaw naw ngmüimkhya upkie, anae, johite naküt a jah näng lawpäng üng Khritaw naw khyawngpe cun Pamhnam üng ap law khai.<verse eid="1CO 15:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 15:25"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:25: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 110:1">Sal 110:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>A yee naküt a khaw kunga am a jah tak hama küt üng, Khritaw naw jah up yah kung khai.<verse eid="1CO 15:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 15:26"/>Ak’hnu säiha ye näng vai cun thihnak kyaki.<verse eid="1CO 15:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 15:27"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:27 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 8:6">Sal 8:6</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Pamhnam naw avan ania khaw kea tak khai,” tia Cangcim naw pyenki. “Avan naküt tak khai” tinak üng Pamhnam amät am ngpüi, Khritawa khaw kea avan takia Pamhnam a ngpüi.<verse eid="1CO 15:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 15:28"/>Acunüng, avan naküt Khritawa upnaka kea taka akya lawpäng üng, Cakpa amät kung Pamhnama kea ve khai acuna Pamhnam naw avan ania kea taki cun naw avan up khai.<verse eid="1CO 15:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 15:29"/>Atuh, khyang kthia thawhnak be am a ve üng, i ja amimi naw yah vai ami äpei. Khyang kthia phäha baptican khankie ihawkba kya khaie. Thikiea phäha ivai baptican khankie ni.<verse eid="1CO 15:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 15:30"/>Ise mimi pi anglät se kyühkse da akcün tä mi dawngki ni?<verse eid="1CO 15:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 15:31"/>Ka püie, amhnüp tä thihnak ka sawngki! Khritaw Jesuh mi Bawipa üng ka ning jah awhcahnak pyen lü, “Kei, a mhnüp tä se ka thiki” ka ti ni.<verse eid="1CO 15:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 15:32"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:32: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 22:13">Hesa 22:13</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nghngicima ngjakhlüa mäih düta Ephet mlüh üng “Sa kyung he” ka jah ngtunpüi vai sü üng i ka ngmang na khai ni? Khyang kthiea thawhnak be am ve khaia akyak üng, “Mi ei lü mi aw be vai u, khawngawi mi thi täng khai” mi ti hlü ye se.<verse eid="1CO 15:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 15:33"/>Käh yu ua. Am dawkia püipaw naw vecawh kpyaki.<verse eid="1CO 15:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 15:34"/>Ngsunpyunnak üng law be u lü, mkhyekatnak hawih ua. Avang naw Pamhnam am ami ksing hin na ngkeei vaia kei naw pyen veng.<verse eid="1CO 15:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pumsa thawhnak be</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 15:35"/>Mat mat naw, “Khyang kthie cun ihawkba tholaw be khaie ni? Ia mäia pumsa na khaie ni?” ti lü ngthäh khai.<verse eid="1CO 15:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 15:36"/>Nang khyang k’ang, namät naw na sawa mci cun am a thih üng am cawt law be;<verse eid="1CO 15:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 15:37"/>Acunüng, na saw cän pumsaa ve khaia am na saw khawiki, a mci va na saw khawiki, cang mcia pi kyase mci kcea pi kyase mci däk va na sawki. Adäm pänga apung am nglingki. Akäna va däm law khai.<verse eid="1CO 15:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 15:38"/>Acunsepi, Pamhnam naw a mäta ngjakhlüa pumsa jah peki, mci naküta veia ami mäta pumsa phäh phäh jah peki.<verse eid="1CO 15:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 15:39"/>Pumsa naküt am täng; nghngicima pumsa mjü at, khisa pumsa mjü at, khaa pumsa mjü at, ngaa pumsa mjü ata kyaki.<verse eid="1CO 15:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 15:40"/>Khankhaw pumsae ve u lü, khawmdek pumsae pi vekie; acunsepi khankhaw pumsaa hlüngtainak hnga lü, khawmdek pumsaa hlüngtainak pi hngaki.<verse eid="1CO 15:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CO 15:41"/>Nghngia hlüngtainak akce, khyaa hlüngtainak akce, aisiea hlüngtainak akce; aisi jah aisi pi ani hlüngtainak am täng ni.<verse eid="1CO 15:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CO 15:42"/>Khyang kthia thawhnak be pi acukba kyaki. Yawk k’uh üng thu lü, a thawh law be üng am thi thei.<verse eid="1CO 15:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CO 15:43"/>K’ut üng am daw lü seki, mthawh be üng ngto lü daw khai.<verse eid="1CO 15:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CO 15:44"/>K’ut üng mtisa pumsaa kya lü; mthawh be üng ngmüimkya pumsaa kya khai. Khawmdek pumsa vekia kyase Ngmüimkhya pumsa pi ve khai.<verse eid="1CO 15:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="1CO 15:45"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:45: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 2:7">Gen 2:7</ref> </char>
    </note>Cangcim naw, “Nghngicim kcük Adam cun khyang xünga mhnünmcenga kyaki”; a tia kyase, Adam anghnu cun xünnak Ngmüimkhya jah peki kyaki.<verse eid="1CO 15:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="1CO 15:46"/>Ngmüimkhya lam cun ve law makia am kya, pumsa lam ve law ma lü acun käna Ngmüimkhya lam ve lawki.<verse eid="1CO 15:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="1CO 15:47"/>Nghngicim akcük cun khawmdek üngkhyüh mhnünmcenga kya lü; anghngihnaka nghngicim cun khankhawa kaa kyaki.<verse eid="1CO 15:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="1CO 15:48"/>Khawmdek üng mhnünmcenga khyange cun khawmdek khyangea mäih law u se; khankhaw üngka khyange cun khankhaw üngka naw lawki hea mäih lawki he.<verse eid="1CO 15:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="1CO 15:49"/>Acunüng, khawmdek üng mhnünmceng khyanga müia mäih mi müinaka mäiha,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:49: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">mi jih khai; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">avang yuknake üng veki</char><char style="fq" closed="false">mi jih vai u.</char></note> khankhaw khyanga müihmai pi mi müihmai na khai.<verse eid="1CO 15:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="1CO 15:50"/>Ka püie aw, pumsa jah thisen Pamhnama pea am ve thei; thi theiki naw am thi theiki cun am yah tia ning jah mtheh veng.<verse eid="1CO 15:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="1CO 15:51"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:51-52: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1TH 4:15-17">1Thes 4:15-17</ref> </char>
    </note>Ngthupki ning jah mtheh vang; mi van mi ip khaia am kya.<verse eid="1CO 15:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="1CO 15:52"/>Acunsepi, ak’hnu säiha kpun a ng'yüng law üng, asängca üng, mik mkhyüpca üng, mi van mi hngalangei law khai. Kpun a ng'yüng law üng thi pängkie cun am pyawih theikia tho law be u se; mimi, mi na vekie pi mi hngalang law khai.<verse eid="1CO 15:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="1CO 15:53"/>Tuhkbäih hina pyawih theiki am pyawih theikia nglat law lü, tuhkbäih hina thi theiki käh thi theikia nglat law khai.<verse eid="1CO 15:53"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="1CO 15:54"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:54: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 25:8">Hesa 25:8</ref> </char>
    </note>Hina thi theiki hin am thi theikia a nglat law üng, “Thihnak cun mkhyüh lü nängnak cun küm law khai” tia Cangcim cun küm law khai.<verse eid="1CO 15:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="1CO 15:55"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:55: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HOS 13:14">Hos 13:14</ref> (LXX)</char>
    </note>“Thihnak aw, na ngnängnak, hawa ni a ve. Aw thihnak aw, na jah kphyaknak vai johit hawa ni a ve?”<verse eid="1CO 15:55"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="1CO 15:56"/>Thihnaka naw johit cun mkhyekatnak üngkhyüh yahki; mkhyekatnaka khyaihnak cun thuma kyaki.<verse eid="1CO 15:56"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="1CO 15:57"/>Acunsepi, mi Bawipa Jesuh Khritaw üng ngnängnak jah pekia Pamhnama veia jenak ve se.<verse eid="1CO 15:57"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="1CO 15:58"/>Acunakyase, ka mhläkphyanaka ka püie aw, khängkia ngdüi ua. Bawipa khutbi ktha na kcang u lü bi ua, Bawipa khutbi nami bi hin am danga am kya tia nami ksingki.<verse eid="1CO 15:58"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="1CO 16"/>
  <para style="s">Hlükawkia phäh petmsawtnak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 16:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 15:25">Rom 15:25</ref>,<ref loc="ROM 15:26">26</ref></char>
    </note>Judah khyawnga veki Pamhnama khyange jah kpüinak vaia ngui nami ngcawna mawng nami yuk lawki. Kalatih mlüha sangcime ka jah mtheha mäiha, nangmi naw pi pawh hnga ua.<verse eid="1CO 16:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 16:2"/>Ka law üng petmsawtnak am ve khaia ngpum mhnüp naküt üng nami khawhthem üngka lo u lü a na mcun ua.<verse eid="1CO 16:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 16:3"/>Ngcawn cehpüi khaia nami jah xüa khyangea veia, ka law käna kcae jah pe lü, nami ngcawn cehpüi khaiea Jerusalema ka jah tüi khai.<verse eid="1CO 16:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 16:4"/>Acunüng, kamät ka cit khaia akyak üng pi, ka hlawnga cit hnga khaie.<verse eid="1CO 16:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pawluha ngtünnak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 16:5"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 19:21">Ngs 19:21</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Acunüng, Maketawniha mlüha ka cit piling khaia kyase, Maketawniha mlüha ka ceh käna nami veia ka law khai;<verse eid="1CO 16:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 16:6"/>Akcea ka ceh üng nami na tha khaia nami veia law lü, khawksik khya üng ta nami hlawnga ka ve hman khai.<verse eid="1CO 16:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 16:7"/>Law sawxat am ni, ning jah hmuh hlü veng, Bawipa naw a dawsak üng nami hlawnga khawvei ka ve khaia ka büki ni.<verse eid="1CO 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 16:8"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 23:15-21">Lev 23:15-21</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 16:9-11">Deut 16:9-11</ref></char>
    </note>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:8,9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 19:8-10">Ngs 19:8-10</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Acunsepi, Pentikos mhnüp veia Ephet mlüha ka ve khai,<verse eid="1CO 16:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 16:9"/>acua bilawh vai ka phäha akdaw vekia kyase ni. Acua am na hmu hlüki pi dakie.<verse eid="1CO 16:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 16:10"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 4:7">1Kor 4:7</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Timoti nami veia a law üng akdaw ana dokham ua. Ani cun pi keia kba Bawipa khutbi biki ni.<verse eid="1CO 16:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 16:11"/>Acunakyase, u naw pi käh hmumsit lü, ka veia a lawnak thei vaia dim’yenak am tha law ua; jumeikie mah mah ka veia law be khaia ka äpeiki.<verse eid="1CO 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 16:12"/>Mi bena Apawluh cun jumeikie am atänga nami veia kdung law khaia ka nghuinak te tukbäih a law vai am yü ham ve;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:12:</char><char style="fq" closed="false">am täng ham; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">am ani üng</char><char style="fq" closed="false">ahin hin Pamhnam hlüei avan am ni.</char></note> akha law üng law khai ni.<verse eid="1CO 16:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ak’hnu säiha khyü</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 16:13"/>Ngsüngcei lü k'äih u, jumnak üng khängcek u, lingnak am kyan u lü ve u. <verse eid="1CO 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 16:14"/>Avan cän Mhläkphyanak am bilo u.<verse eid="1CO 16:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 16:15"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 1:16">1Kor 1:16</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Stephena kyawnglawng cun nami jah ksingki, amimi cun Akaijah hnea jumei law kcük u lü, Pamhnama khyang ngcime jah khüih petkie ni. Ka püie ning jah nghui na veng, <verse eid="1CO 16:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 16:16"/>acuna khawngmange cun jah läk ua, ami am atänga khutbi ua.<verse eid="1CO 16:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 16:17"/>Acunüng, Stephen, Photunat ja Akaikas ami law hin je veng; am nami ve pi am ka ksing khaia na pawh ve u.<verse eid="1CO 16:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 16:18"/>Amimi naw kei ami na jesaka kba nangmi naw pi nami na jesaki, acunakyase, ahina mäihe cän jah ümnak ni.<verse eid="1CO 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 16:19"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 18:2">Ngs 18:2</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Asah hne sangcime naw ning jah hnukset ve u. Akuilah jah Priscilah ima veki sangcime naw pi Bawipa ngming üng ning jah hnukset ve u.<verse eid="1CO 16:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 16:20"/>Jumeikie naküt naw ning jah hnukset ve u. Dimyenaka mhnamnak am nghnuksetei ua.<verse eid="1CO 16:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 16:21"/>Kei Pawluh naw kamäta kut am yu lü ning jah nghnukset veng.<verse eid="1CO 16:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 16:22"/>Au pi Bawipa am mhlänaki ta yüncenak yah khai! Maranatha — Kami Bawipa, lawa!<verse eid="1CO 16:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 16:23"/>Bawipa Jesuh Khritawa bäkhäknak nami khana ve se.<verse eid="1CO 16:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 16:24"/>Jesuh Khritaw üng nami vana khana ka mhlänak ve se.<verse eid="1CO 16:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 16"/>
</usx>
